{"drafts":[{"assumptions":["Q-6 (human answer) treats saved basket templates as existing, so templates are in scope as private-per-Buyer (REQ-38), which overrides ASM-1.","Q-8 overrides ASM-7: an order is rejected at submission and at confirmation if a line's quantity is above the last imported stock quantity, and orders placed since the import are not subtracted.","ASM-31 overrides ASM-3: prices are entered and shown excluding tax, and invoices add tax at one configurable rate.","ASM-35 overrides ASM-13: there is one saved basket per Buyer that persists across sessions and devices.","ASM-30 overrides ASM-2 on the label: products with no price show 'Price on request', and this also applies when the assigned price list is deactivated.","Order emails go to the Buyer who placed the order. For staff-created orders they go to the company's contact email.","When staff cancel an order after confirmation, the same rule as rejection applies: a reason is required and the customer gets an email.","Price validation at checkout rejects a submission if any price has changed since review, and returns the new prices so the Buyer can confirm again.","An order must keep at least one line. Removing every line is done by cancelling the order.","Order notes are limited to 1000 characters.","Image limits are JPEG/PNG/WebP up to 5 MB. The request leaves formats and size open.","Reports are calculated from the net totals of invoices dated in the selected range, so cancelled and undelivered orders are left out.","The delivery-list CSV columns are order number, customer, delivery address, contact name, contact phone, delivery date, line summary, note and status. Cancelled orders are left out.","Office staff can view customer pricing but cannot edit it. Staff and admins can maintain customer companies and their delivery addresses.","Test classes named in unit criteria (StockStatusPolicy, DeliveryDateCalculator, InvoiceStatusPolicy) are proposed names for this new build, since no code exists yet.","The NFR numbers (catalogue size, concurrency, retention, timeouts) are proposed targets because the request does not give any."],"nfrs":[{"id":"NFR-1","metric":"p95 response time ≤ 1.0 s","text":"Catalogue text, category and vehicle searches respond within the target with a catalogue of 50,000 active products and 50 concurrent users."},{"id":"NFR-2","metric":"p95 ≤ 2.0 s","text":"Order submission, including stock and price validation, completes within the target for baskets of up to 100 lines."},{"id":"NFR-3","metric":"≤ 15 minutes end to end","text":"The nightly stock import finishes within the target for a file of 100,000 rows."},{"id":"NFR-4","metric":"p95 ≤ 5 s","text":"Invoice PDF generation completes within the target for invoices of up to 200 lines."},{"id":"NFR-5","metric":"0 plaintext passwords found in database and log scan","text":"Passwords are stored only as salted hashes using bcrypt (cost ≥ 12) or Argon2id; no plaintext password appears in storage or logs."},{"id":"NFR-6","metric":"TLS 1.2 or higher only; idle session timeout 30 minutes; absolute session lifetime 12 hours","text":"All traffic is served over TLS; sessions expire after inactivity."},{"id":"NFR-7","metric":"≥ 99.5% monthly","text":"Portal availability during business hours (07:00–19:00 in the configured timezone, working days)."},{"id":"NFR-8","metric":"≥ 7 years, 0 deletions through any application function","text":"Audit entries, orders and invoices are retained."},{"id":"NFR-9","metric":"WCAG 2.1 AA, 0 critical issues in automated audit","text":"Customer-facing screens meet accessibility standards."},{"id":"NFR-10","metric":"≥ 99% handed off within 60 s","text":"Order and status emails are handed to the email service promptly after the triggering action."}],"outOfScope":["Customer Account Manager role; all Buyers see all company orders and invoices instead (Q-1)","Customer-created or customer-edited delivery addresses (Q-5)","Templates shared across Buyers of a company (Q-6)","SMS or push notifications; editable email templates (ASM-15, ASM-25, ASM-26)","Social login or single sign-on (ASM-36)","Nested categories (ASM-19, ASM-37)","Multiple currencies (ASM-4)","Migration of existing customers, products, price lists and users; system starts empty with seed data (ASM-23)","Custom report builder (ASM-21)","Bulk import of vehicle compatibility data; entered manually by admins (ASM-20)","Separate Rejected order status (ASM-14, ASM-38)","Online card payments (stated out of scope in request section 32)","Backorders (stated out of scope in request section 8)","Route planning (stated out of scope in request section 22)","Writing or decrementing stock in the ERP or in the portal (request section 9; Q-8)","Volume pricing, promotional pricing, discounts and price effective dates (request section 10 lists them as open; not requested)","Multi-region hosting; one cloud region in the client's account (ASM-24)"],"requirements":[{"acceptance":[{"given":"An active Customer Buyer account buyer@a.com with password 'Correct#1' in an active company","id":"AC-1.1","level":"api","then":"Response is success, a session is issued, and a follow-up request to the Buyer's order list returns 200","when":"POST sign-in with buyer@a.com / Correct#1"},{"given":"An active account buyer@a.com","id":"AC-1.2","level":"api","then":"Both responses are rejected with the same 'Invalid email or password' message and no session is issued","when":"POST sign-in with buyer@a.com / WrongPass, and separately with unknown@x.com / any"},{"given":"A signed-in user","id":"AC-1.3","level":"api","then":"The request with the old token is rejected as unauthenticated (401)","when":"The user signs out and then reuses the old session token"}],"ears":"When a user submits an email address and password that match an active account, the portal shall start an authenticated session for that user's role.","id":"REQ-1","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-1"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An active account with 4 consecutive failed attempts","id":"AC-2.1","level":"api","then":"The 5th response and the correct-password attempt both return an 'account temporarily locked' message and no session","when":"A 5th wrong password is submitted, then the correct password is submitted 1 minute later"},{"given":"An account locked at 10:00","id":"AC-2.2","level":"api","then":"Sign-in succeeds and the failed-attempt counter is reset to 0","when":"The correct password is submitted at 10:15:01"},{"given":"An account with 3 failed attempts","id":"AC-2.3","level":"api","then":"The account is not locked","when":"A successful sign-in occurs, followed by 4 failed attempts"}],"ears":"If 5 consecutive failed sign-in attempts are made for one account, then the portal shall lock that account for 15 minutes and tell the user it is temporarily locked.","id":"REQ-2","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","ASM-5"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A registered active user","id":"AC-3.1","level":"api","then":"An email is sent to the email service containing a reset link; the new password works for sign-in, the old one fails, and reusing the link is rejected","when":"POST forgot-password with their email, then the link is used within 1 hour to set a new password"},{"given":"A reset link issued at 09:00","id":"AC-3.2","level":"api","then":"The reset is rejected as expired and the password is unchanged","when":"The link is used at 10:00:01"},{"given":"An unknown email address","id":"AC-3.3","level":"api","then":"The response is identical to the registered-email case and no email is sent","when":"POST forgot-password with it"},{"given":"An account locked by failed attempts at 10:00","id":"AC-3.4","level":"api","then":"Sign-in is still rejected as locked until 10:15","when":"The user resets their password at 10:05 and signs in with the new password at 10:06"}],"ears":"When a user requests a password reset for their email address, the portal shall email a single-use reset link that is valid for 1 hour.","id":"REQ-3","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","ASM-16","ASM-17","ASM-36"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An admin","id":"AC-4.1","level":"api","then":"An invitation email is sent; the account status becomes Active and the user can sign in","when":"The admin invites new@a.com as Customer Buyer of company A and the invitee sets a password via the link within 7 days"},{"given":"An invitation sent 7 days and 1 minute ago","id":"AC-4.2","level":"api","then":"The link is rejected as expired; after the admin resends the invitation, the new link works and the old link is rejected","when":"The invitee opens the link"},{"given":"An admin","id":"AC-4.3","level":"api","then":"The request is rejected because the role does not exist","when":"The admin tries to invite a user with role 'Customer Account Manager'"}],"ears":"When an administrator invites a Customer Buyer or Office Staff user, the portal shall email an invitation link valid for 7 days that lets the user set a password and activates the account.","id":"REQ-4","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-17","ASM-16","Q-1"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Buyer with 2 orders (one Received) whose account is deactivated","id":"AC-5.1","level":"api","then":"Sign-in is rejected; staff can still view both orders with unchanged status","when":"The Buyer attempts to sign in"},{"given":"A signed-in Buyer whose company is set to inactive","id":"AC-5.2","level":"api","then":"The submission is rejected and no order row is created; the company's Received order keeps status Received","when":"The Buyer submits an order"}],"ears":"If a deactivated user, or a user of an inactive customer company, attempts to sign in or place an order, then the portal shall reject the attempt while keeping the user's and company's existing orders and invoices unchanged.","id":"REQ-5","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-17","ASM-18","ASM-34"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Buyers B1 and B2 in company A and Buyer C1 in company C, each with orders","id":"AC-6.1","level":"api","then":"B1's list contains B1's and B2's orders only; requests for C1's order and invoice return 404","when":"B1 lists orders and requests C1's order and invoice by ID"},{"given":"A signed-in Buyer","id":"AC-6.2","level":"api","then":"Both return 403","when":"The Buyer calls a staff endpoint (order queue) and an admin endpoint (price list list)"},{"given":"An unauthenticated client","id":"AC-6.3","level":"api","then":"All return 401","when":"It calls the catalogue, order or invoice endpoints"}],"ears":"The portal shall restrict each Customer Buyer to the orders, invoices, prices, addresses and account data of the Buyer's own customer company.","id":"REQ-6","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","Q-1","I-3","I-5"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Active products 'Brake Pad Set' (code BP-100, MPN 0986-494, brand Bosch) and 'Oil Filter' (code OF-200), and retired product 'Brake Disc'","id":"AC-7.1","level":"api","then":"'brake' returns only Brake Pad Set; each of the other terms returns Brake Pad Set; Brake Disc is never returned","when":"Search 'brake', 'bp-1', '494' and 'bosch'"}],"ears":"When a Customer Buyer searches the catalogue with a text term, the portal shall return active products whose name, distributor product code, manufacturer part number or brand contains the term, ignoring letter case.","id":"REQ-7","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-10"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Products in categories Filters (2) and Brake system (3)","id":"AC-8.1","level":"api","then":"Results are 2, then 3, then 5 products","when":"Filter by Filters, then by Brake system, then clear the filter"},{"given":"A retired category Exhaust","id":"AC-8.2","level":"api","then":"Exhaust is not in the list","when":"The Buyer lists categories"}],"ears":"When a Customer Buyer filters the catalogue by a category, the portal shall return only active products assigned to that flat, single-level category.","id":"REQ-8","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-10","ASM-19","ASM-37"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P1 compatible with Ford Focus 2018 1.0 EcoBoost Petrol Titanium, and P2 compatible with Ford Focus 2018 1.5 TDCi Diesel","id":"AC-9.1","level":"api","then":"First search returns P1 and P2; second returns only P2","when":"Search make=Ford, model=Focus, year=2018, then add fuel type=Diesel"}],"ears":"When a Customer Buyer searches by vehicle using any combination of make, model, year, engine, fuel type and variant, the portal shall return the active products that have a compatibility record matching every supplied value.","id":"REQ-9","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-10","ASM-20"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P priced 10.00 on Standard and 8.50 on Fleet; company A on Fleet, company B on Standard","id":"AC-10.1","level":"api","then":"A sees 8.50 and B sees 10.00; neither response contains the other price list's price","when":"Buyers of A and B request product P detail"},{"given":"Product P with image, name, code, manufacturer, description, unit, pack size and two compatibility records","id":"AC-10.2","level":"api","then":"The response contains all of those fields, the price and the stock status","when":"A Buyer requests product P detail"}],"ears":"When a Customer Buyer views a catalogue list or a product detail, the portal shall show for each product the price from the company's assigned price list, excluding tax, together with the product's stock status.","id":"REQ-10","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-11","I-10"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product Q missing from company A's price list","id":"AC-11.1","level":"api","then":"Q is shown with 'Price on request' and no price; the add is rejected and the basket is unchanged","when":"A Buyer of A views Q and then adds Q to the basket"},{"given":"Company A's assigned price list is deactivated","id":"AC-11.2","level":"api","then":"Every product shows 'Price on request'","when":"A Buyer of A views any product"}],"ears":"If a product has no price on the customer's assigned price list or that price list is deactivated, then the portal shall show the product as 'Price on request' and reject adding it to the basket.","id":"REQ-11","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-11","ASM-30","ASM-2"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Low-stock threshold setting = 5","id":"AC-12.1","level":"unit","then":"Results are Out of stock, Low stock, Low stock, In stock","when":"StockStatusPolicy.statusFor is called with quantities 0, 1, 5 and 6"}],"ears":"The portal shall derive each product's stock status from its last imported quantity as Out of stock at 0, Low stock from 1 up to and including the low-stock threshold setting, and In stock above the threshold.","id":"REQ-12","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-12","ASM-6","ASM-27"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Products BP-100 (qty 3) and OF-200 (qty 0) and a valid CSV with BP-100=20, OF-200=4 in the configured location","id":"AC-13.1","level":"job","then":"BP-100 has quantity 20 and status In stock, OF-200 has 4; an import log row shows Success with 2 rows applied","when":"The import job runs"},{"given":"A completed import","id":"AC-13.2","level":"job","then":"No outbound call is made to the ERP","when":"The job finishes"}],"ears":"When the scheduled stock import job runs, the portal shall read the ERP CSV from the configured file location, replace the stored quantity of every matching product, and record the import result with its timestamp and row counts.","id":"REQ-13","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12","ASM-8","ASM-33"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"BP-100 quantity 20 and a CSV with a missing quantity column","id":"AC-14.1","level":"job","then":"BP-100 still has quantity 20; an import log row shows Failed with a reason; the staff dashboard shows the failed import","when":"The import job runs"},{"given":"A CSV where one of 3 rows has quantity 'abc' or a negative number","id":"AC-14.2","level":"job","then":"No quantities change and the import is logged as Failed","when":"The import job runs"}],"ears":"If the ERP stock file is missing, unreadable, or fails validation of its header or quantity values, then the portal shall keep all previous stock data unchanged and record a failed import visible to staff and admins.","id":"REQ-14","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A valid CSV with BP-100=7 and XX-999=5 where XX-999 is unknown","id":"AC-15.1","level":"job","then":"BP-100 has quantity 7; the import log lists XX-999 as skipped and shows 1 applied, 1 skipped","when":"The import job runs"}],"ears":"If a valid ERP stock file contains product identifiers that match no product, then the portal shall skip those rows, apply the matching rows, and list the skipped identifiers in the import log.","id":"REQ-15","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12","ASM-9"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Buyer adds 2 x P (8.50) and 1 x Q (4.00)","id":"AC-16.1","level":"api","then":"The basket shows 1 line: P x3, line total 25.50, subtotal 25.50","when":"The Buyer changes P to 3, removes Q, signs out and signs in on another client"},{"given":"A Buyer adds P with quantity 0 or -1","id":"AC-16.2","level":"api","then":"It is rejected and the basket is unchanged","when":"The add request is sent"}],"ears":"While a Customer Buyer has items in the basket, the portal shall keep that one basket per Buyer across sessions and devices, showing each line's unit price, line total and the basket subtotal excluding tax, until the Buyer checks out or empties it.","id":"REQ-16","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","ASM-35"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Cutoff 14:00, no extra non-working dates","id":"AC-17.1","level":"unit","then":"Results are Tuesday and Wednesday","when":"DeliveryDateCalculator.earliestDeliveryDate is called with Monday 13:59 and Monday 14:00"},{"given":"Cutoff 14:00 and Tuesday listed as a non-working date","id":"AC-17.2","level":"unit","then":"Monday 13:00 gives Wednesday; Friday 15:00 gives the following Tuesday... (Monday is next working day, so result is the working day after Monday, skipping the holiday Tuesday: Wednesday)","when":"Called with Monday 13:00, and with Friday 15:00"},{"given":"Timezone Europe/London and cutoff 14:00","id":"AC-17.3","level":"unit","then":"Result is Wednesday","when":"Called with 13:30 UTC on a summer Monday (14:30 local)"}],"ears":"The portal shall calculate the earliest delivery date as the next working day for orders placed before the cutoff time setting and the second working day for orders placed at or after it, in the configured timezone, excluding weekends and admin-maintained non-working dates.","id":"REQ-17","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","ASM-11","ASM-27","ASM-28","ASM-5"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Earliest date Tuesday and booking horizon 30 days","id":"AC-18.1","level":"api","then":"Each submission is rejected with a delivery-date error and no order is created","when":"The Buyer submits with Monday (before earliest), a Saturday, a listed non-working date, and a date 31 days ahead"},{"given":"Earliest date Tuesday","id":"AC-18.2","level":"api","then":"The list starts at Tuesday and contains only working days up to 30 days ahead","when":"The Buyer requests available delivery dates"}],"ears":"If a submitted delivery date is not a working day between the earliest delivery date and the booking-horizon setting in days ahead, then the portal shall reject the order submission.","id":"REQ-18","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","ASM-12","ASM-29"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A with addresses A1, A2 and company C with address C1","id":"AC-19.1","level":"api","then":"C1 is rejected; A2 is accepted and stored on the order","when":"A Buyer of A submits with C1, and then with A2"},{"given":"A signed-in Buyer","id":"AC-19.2","level":"api","then":"The request returns 403","when":"The Buyer attempts to create or edit a delivery address"}],"ears":"When a Customer Buyer selects a delivery address at checkout, the portal shall accept only an active address that staff or admins maintain for the Buyer's company.","id":"REQ-19","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","Q-5"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"P with imported quantity 5 and another order for 4 x P already placed since the import","id":"AC-20.1","level":"api","then":"The order is accepted (quantities from orders placed since the import are not subtracted)","when":"A Buyer submits 5 x P"},{"given":"P with imported quantity 5 and Q with imported quantity 0","id":"AC-20.2","level":"api","then":"Both are rejected naming the affected line and no order is created","when":"A Buyer submits 6 x P, and separately 1 x Q"},{"given":"P with imported quantity 5","id":"AC-20.3","level":"api","then":"P's stored quantity remains 5","when":"An order for 5 x P is submitted"}],"ears":"If any line's ordered quantity exceeds the product's last imported stock quantity when an order is submitted, then the portal shall reject the submission and identify the affected lines.","id":"REQ-20","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","I-3","Q-8","ASM-7"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"P in the basket at 8.50 and the admin changes P to 9.00 on the Buyer's list","id":"AC-21.1","level":"api","then":"Submission is rejected with P's new price 9.00; resubmitting after review creates the order at 9.00","when":"The Buyer submits the order with the 8.50 review"}],"ears":"If a line's price on the customer's current price list differs from the price shown in the basket when the order is submitted, then the portal shall reject the submission and return the updated prices for review.","id":"REQ-21","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","I-11"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Last order number ORD-000122 and a valid basket of 3 x P at 8.50 with note 'Rear door'","id":"AC-22.1","level":"api","then":"Order ORD-000123 exists with status Received, line 3 x P at 8.50, total 25.50, the note, a timeline entry 'Received' with the Buyer as actor; the basket is empty; the order appears in the staff queue","when":"The Buyer submits"},{"given":"An order note of 1001 characters","id":"AC-22.2","level":"api","then":"Submission is rejected (note limit 1000 characters)","when":"The Buyer submits"}],"ears":"When a valid order is submitted, the portal shall create the order with a sequential number of the form ORD-000123, status Received, the order-time unit prices, delivery address, delivery date and optional note, and empty the Buyer's basket.","id":"REQ-22","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","I-1","I-4","ASM-22"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Order ORD-000123 with P at 8.50","id":"AC-23.1","level":"api","then":"The order still shows 8.50 and the generated invoice line shows 8.50","when":"The admin changes P to 9.00 and the order is later delivered"}],"ears":"When a price list price is changed, the portal shall leave the unit prices of existing orders and invoices unchanged.","id":"REQ-23","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-11","I-16"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An order in Confirmed","id":"AC-24.1","level":"api","then":"Picking succeeds and the timeline gains an entry with Picking, timestamp and staff user; Delivered is rejected","when":"Staff set status to Picking, then attempt Delivered"},{"given":"An order in Picking","id":"AC-24.2","level":"api","then":"The change is rejected","when":"Staff attempt to set it back to Confirmed"}],"ears":"When staff change an order's status, the portal shall allow only the next step in the sequence Received, Confirmed, Picking, Out for delivery, Delivered and record a timeline entry with the status, timestamp and acting user.","id":"REQ-24","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","Q-3"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Orders in Received and in Out for delivery","id":"AC-25.1","level":"api","then":"Both become Cancelled with reason, user and timestamp in the timeline; one email per order is sent to the email service containing the order number and reason","when":"Staff cancel each with reason 'Customer phoned'"},{"given":"An order in Delivered, and an order in Received","id":"AC-25.2","level":"api","then":"Both requests are rejected and statuses are unchanged","when":"Staff cancel the Delivered order, and cancel the Received order without a reason"}],"ears":"When staff reject or cancel an order that is not Delivered, the portal shall set it to Cancelled, record the mandatory reason, acting user and timestamp, and email the customer the reason.","id":"REQ-25","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","Q-3","ASM-14","ASM-38","ASM-26","ASM-15"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Order in Received with 5 x P","id":"AC-26.1","level":"api","then":"The order shows 3 x P with recalculated total; amendment history shows staff user, timestamp, P quantity 5→3 and address A1→A2; the Buyer's order detail shows the amendments","when":"Staff change P to 3 and the delivery address to A2"},{"given":"Order in Confirmed","id":"AC-26.2","level":"api","then":"The change is rejected","when":"Staff try to change a quantity"},{"given":"Order in Received","id":"AC-26.3","level":"api","then":"Each change is rejected (an order must keep at least one line; cancellation is used instead)","when":"Staff change the delivery date to a non-working day, or remove the last remaining line"}],"ears":"While an order is in Received status, the portal shall let staff change line quantities, remove lines, and change the delivery date, delivery address and note, recording each change in the order's amendment history.","id":"REQ-26","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","I-8"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Order ORD-000123 in Received placed by Buyer B1 with 5 x P","id":"AC-27.1","level":"api","then":"One email to B1 is sent to the email service containing ORD-000123 and 'P: 5 → 3'","when":"Staff change P to 3"}],"ears":"When staff change the quantity of a line on a Received order, the portal shall email the customer the order number and each changed line's old and new quantity.","id":"REQ-27","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","ASM-15","ASM-25"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Order in Received with 3 x P, P imported quantity 10, active company","id":"AC-28.1","level":"api","then":"Status is Confirmed with confirming user and timestamp in the timeline; an email with order number, lines, delivery date and address and any staff amendments is sent; the Buyer can no longer cancel it","when":"Staff confirm"},{"given":"Order with 3 x P where P's imported quantity is now 2, or the company is inactive","id":"AC-28.2","level":"api","then":"Confirmation is rejected naming the reason and status stays Received","when":"Staff confirm"}],"ears":"When staff confirm a Received order, the portal shall check every line's quantity against the last imported stock quantity and the customer company's active status, then set the order to Confirmed and email the customer the order details.","id":"REQ-28","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","Q-8","ASM-15"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Order ORD-000123 in Picking","id":"AC-29.1","level":"api","then":"One email containing ORD-000123 and 'out for delivery' is sent to the email service","when":"Staff set it to Out for delivery"}],"ears":"When an order's status changes to Out for delivery, the portal shall email the customer an email identifying the order and stating that it is out for delivery.","id":"REQ-29","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","I-5","ASM-15"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A on the Fleet price list (P = 8.50)","id":"AC-30.1","level":"api","then":"The order is Received at 8.50, shows 'created by staff' with the staff user, and appears in every A Buyer's order list","when":"Staff create an order for A with 2 x P, address A1, a valid date"},{"given":"Company A","id":"AC-30.2","level":"api","then":"The submission is rejected","when":"Staff submit an order for A using company C's address or a quantity above imported stock"}],"ears":"When staff submit an order on behalf of a customer company, the portal shall apply the same price, stock, address and delivery-date rules as customer checkout and record the order as created by that staff user.","id":"REQ-30","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","I-14"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Orders: A/Received/1 Oct, A/Confirmed/2 Oct, C/Received/2 Oct","id":"AC-31.1","level":"api","then":"Results are 2, 2 and 2 orders respectively with all listed fields","when":"Staff filter by customer A, then status Received, then date 2 Oct–2 Oct"}],"ears":"When staff open the order queue, the portal shall list orders with order number, customer, order date, requested delivery date, total and status, filterable by customer, order date range and status.","id":"REQ-31","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"For 6 Oct: one Confirmed and one Cancelled order; one Confirmed order on 7 Oct","id":"AC-32.1","level":"api","then":"The CSV has a header row and exactly one data row with all listed columns for the Confirmed 6 Oct order","when":"Staff export the list for 6 Oct"}],"ears":"When staff export the delivery list for a date, the portal shall return a CSV with one row per non-cancelled order due that date containing order number, customer, delivery address, contact name and phone, delivery date, line summary, note and status.","id":"REQ-32","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"2 Received, 1 Picking, 1 Out for delivery orders, 1 order due today, 3 unpaid invoices, latest import Failed","id":"AC-33.1","level":"api","then":"The response shows 2, 1, 1, 1, 3 and a Failed import with its timestamp","when":"Staff request the dashboard"}],"ears":"When staff or admins open the dashboard, the portal shall show the counts of Received, Picking and Out for delivery orders, orders due for delivery today, unpaid or overdue invoices, and the result of the latest stock import.","id":"REQ-33","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6","I-12"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A with 3 orders from two Buyers, one Cancelled","id":"AC-34.1","level":"api","then":"First list has 3 orders with all fields; filtered list has 1","when":"A Buyer lists orders, then filters by status Cancelled"}],"ears":"When a Customer Buyer lists orders, the portal shall return all orders of the Buyer's company with order number, order date, delivery date, delivery address, total and status, filterable by status and order date range.","id":"REQ-34","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-15","Q-1"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Confirmed order with one staff quantity amendment","id":"AC-35.1","level":"api","then":"All listed fields are present, the timeline shows Received and Confirmed with timestamps, and the amendment is shown","when":"The Buyer requests the order detail"}],"ears":"When a Customer Buyer opens an order of their company, the portal shall show its number, date, customer, delivery address, requested delivery date, status, status timeline, lines with quantities, unit prices and line totals, order total, note and staff amendments.","id":"REQ-35","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-15"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Received order","id":"AC-36.1","level":"api","then":"Status becomes Cancelled with a timeline entry naming the Buyer","when":"A Buyer of the company cancels it"},{"given":"A Confirmed order","id":"AC-36.2","level":"api","then":"The request is rejected with a message to contact the distributor office, and status stays Confirmed","when":"The Buyer cancels it"}],"ears":"While an order is in Received status, the portal shall let a Customer Buyer of that company cancel it.","id":"REQ-36","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-15"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Past order with 2 x P (then 8.00, now 8.50), 1 x R (retired), 1 x Q (out of stock)","id":"AC-37.1","level":"api","then":"The basket gains 2 x P at 8.50; R and Q are returned as flagged and not added; the company's order count is unchanged","when":"The Buyer repeats the order"}],"ears":"When a Customer Buyer repeats a previous order, the portal shall add the orderable lines to the Buyer's basket at current price-list prices and flag the lines that are retired, out of stock or without a price, without creating an order.","id":"REQ-37","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-15","I-13"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Buyer B1 saves a basket as 'Weekly Workshop Order'","id":"AC-38.1","level":"api","then":"B1 sees the template; B2 sees none and requesting it by ID returns 404","when":"B1 and B2 (same company) list templates"},{"given":"B1's template with 2 x P (P price now 8.50) and 1 x R (retired)","id":"AC-38.2","level":"api","then":"Basket gains 2 x P at 8.50, R is flagged; the template no longer appears in B1's list","when":"B1 adds the template to the basket, then deletes the template"}],"ears":"When a Customer Buyer saves the basket as a named template, the portal shall store the template privately for that Buyer and, when the template is added to the basket, use current price-list prices and flag unavailable products.","id":"REQ-38","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","Q-6"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Order ORD-000123 with 3 x P at 8.50 (net 25.50), tax rate setting 20%","id":"AC-39.1","level":"api","then":"Exactly one invoice exists for the order with status Unpaid, net 25.50, tax 5.10, total 30.60, and a sequential INV- number","when":"Staff set it to Delivered"}],"ears":"When an order's status changes to Delivered, the portal shall create an Unpaid invoice numbered in the form INV-000123 with the customer, billing address, order number, invoice date, lines at order-time prices, net total, tax at the configured rate and gross total.","id":"REQ-39","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-16","ASM-22","ASM-31","ASM-3"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A has 2 invoices, company C has 1","id":"AC-40.1","level":"api","then":"The Buyer sees A's 2 invoices; staff see all 3","when":"A Buyer of A lists invoices; staff list invoices"}],"ears":"When a Customer Buyer lists invoices, the portal shall return every invoice of the Buyer's company with number, order number, invoice date, total and payment status.","id":"REQ-40","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-16","Q-2"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Invoice INV-000123 for company A","id":"AC-41.1","level":"api","then":"Response content type is application/pdf and the extracted text contains all listed values","when":"A Buyer of A downloads the PDF"}],"ears":"When a Customer Buyer or staff user downloads an invoice, the portal shall return a PDF containing the invoice number, customer, billing address, order number, invoice date, lines, quantities, prices, net total, tax, total and payment status.","id":"REQ-41","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-16"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An Unpaid invoice","id":"AC-42.1","level":"api","then":"Status is Paid with payment date 2026-10-10 and the staff user recorded","when":"Staff mark it paid with payment date 2026-10-10"},{"given":"An Unpaid invoice dated 2026-10-05","id":"AC-42.2","level":"api","then":"Missing/future date returns a validation error; the Buyer gets 403","when":"Staff mark it paid without a date, with a future date, or a Buyer attempts to mark it paid"}],"ears":"When staff mark an invoice as paid with a payment date, the portal shall set its status to Paid and record the payment date and the recording user.","id":"REQ-42","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-16"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Overdue-days setting 30 and an unpaid invoice dated 1 Sep","id":"AC-43.1","level":"unit","then":"1 Oct gives Unpaid; 2 Oct gives Overdue; a Paid invoice dated 1 Sep gives Paid on 2 Oct","when":"InvoiceStatusPolicy.statusFor is evaluated on 1 Oct and on 2 Oct"}],"ears":"While an invoice is unpaid and more than the overdue-days setting has passed since its invoice date, the portal shall report its status as Overdue.","id":"REQ-43","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-16","ASM-32","ASM-10"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An admin","id":"AC-44.1","level":"api","then":"The duplicate code is rejected; with a unique code the product is created and appears in catalogue search","when":"The admin creates a product with all fields and a distributor code already used by another product"},{"given":"Product P on a past order","id":"AC-44.2","level":"api","then":"P no longer appears in the catalogue but the past order still shows P's name and code","when":"The admin retires P"}],"ears":"When an administrator adds, edits or retires a product, the portal shall store its name, distributor product code, manufacturer part number, description, category, brand, unit of sale, pack size and status, keeping retired products visible in historical orders and invoices.","id":"REQ-44","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17","I-10"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An admin","id":"AC-45.1","level":"api","then":"Buyers see 'Cooling system', then 'Cooling' with P, then no such category","when":"The admin creates 'Cooling system', assigns P to it, renames it 'Cooling', then retires it"}],"ears":"When an administrator creates, edits or retires a category or assigns a product to it, the portal shall apply the change to catalogue category filtering.","id":"REQ-45","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17","I-10","ASM-19"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An admin and product P","id":"AC-46.1","level":"api","then":"The PNG is stored and returned in P's detail; the 6 MB JPEG and the PDF are rejected and the PNG remains","when":"The admin uploads a 2 MB PNG, then a 6 MB JPEG, then a PDF"}],"ears":"When an administrator uploads a product image, the portal shall accept only JPEG, PNG or WebP files of at most 5 MB and replace any previous image of that product.","id":"REQ-46","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P with no compatibility records","id":"AC-47.1","level":"api","then":"Vehicle search for Golf 2019 returns P after the add and not after the removal; Focus search still returns P","when":"The admin adds Ford Focus 2018 1.5 TDCi Diesel and VW Golf 2019 2.0 TDI Diesel to P, then removes the Golf record"}],"ears":"When an administrator adds or removes a vehicle compatibility record of make, model, year, engine, fuel type and variant for a product, the portal shall apply it to vehicle search and product detail.","id":"REQ-47","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17","I-10","ASM-20"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Price lists Standard (P=10.00) and Dealer (P=9.00); company A on Standard","id":"AC-48.1","level":"api","then":"A's Buyers see P at 9.00","when":"The admin assigns Dealer to A"},{"given":"Dealer has P=9.00","id":"AC-48.2","level":"api","then":"Both are rejected","when":"The admin adds a second price for P on Dealer, or a negative price"},{"given":"A signed-in Office Staff user","id":"AC-48.3","level":"api","then":"Viewing succeeds; editing returns 403","when":"The user views company A's assigned price list and prices, and attempts to edit a price"}],"ears":"When an administrator creates, renames or deactivates a price list, sets, edits or removes a product price on it, or assigns it to a customer company, the portal shall apply the change to that company's displayed prices with one price per product per price list.","id":"REQ-48","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-11","I-17"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An admin","id":"AC-49.1","level":"api","then":"Company A is stored with 3 delivery addresses available at checkout","when":"The admin creates company A with all fields and two delivery addresses, then staff add a third address"},{"given":"Company A exists with account number 1001","id":"AC-49.2","level":"api","then":"The request is rejected","when":"Another company is created with account number 1001"},{"given":"Staff user","id":"AC-49.3","level":"api","then":"Matching companies are returned and A's details, users, orders and invoices are viewable","when":"Staff search customers by name fragment and open company A"}],"ears":"When staff or an administrator maintains a customer company, the portal shall store its name, unique account number, primary contact, contact email and phone, billing address, delivery addresses, assigned price list and active status.","id":"REQ-49","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17","Q-5","ASM-34"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A signed-in Buyer with past orders","id":"AC-50.1","level":"api","then":"The user's next request returns 401, sign-in is rejected, and past orders remain visible to staff","when":"The admin deactivates the user"},{"given":"A deactivated user","id":"AC-50.2","level":"api","then":"The user can sign in again","when":"The admin reactivates the user"},{"given":"An admin","id":"AC-50.3","level":"api","then":"Each user shows role, company (if a Buyer) and status Invited, Active or Deactivated","when":"The admin lists users"}],"ears":"When an administrator deactivates, reactivates, changes the role of, or changes the company of a user, the portal shall apply the change from that user's next request while keeping the user's historical records.","id":"REQ-50","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17","I-9","Q-1"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Cutoff 14:00","id":"AC-51.1","level":"api","then":"Earliest date is Wednesday","when":"The admin changes cutoff to 12:00 and a Buyer requests delivery dates at Monday 13:00"},{"given":"An admin","id":"AC-51.2","level":"api","then":"Both are rejected","when":"The admin sets low-stock threshold to -1 or tax rate to 150%"},{"given":"An Office Staff user","id":"AC-51.3","level":"api","then":"The request returns 403","when":"The user tries to edit settings"}],"ears":"Where an administrator edits system settings, the portal shall use the stored values of order cutoff time, timezone, low-stock threshold, non-working dates, booking horizon, overdue days, tax rate and currency for all subsequent calculations.","id":"REQ-51","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17","ASM-4","ASM-5","ASM-27","ASM-28","ASM-29","ASM-31","ASM-32"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P priced 8.50 on Fleet","id":"AC-52.1","level":"api","then":"An audit entry exists with user X, timestamp, entity price list Fleet/P, field price, old 8.50, new 9.00","when":"Admin X changes it to 9.00"},{"given":"An Unpaid invoice","id":"AC-52.2","level":"api","then":"An audit entry records the staff user, timestamp, status Unpaid→Paid and payment date null→the given date","when":"Staff mark it paid"},{"given":"Existing audit entries","id":"AC-52.3","level":"api","then":"No such operation is available (405/404) and the entry is unchanged","when":"Any user, including an admin, attempts to edit or delete an audit entry"}],"ears":"When an order, invoice, customer company, delivery address, user, product, category, price list, price or compatibility record is created, changed or deleted, the portal shall record an audit entry with the acting user or system, timestamp, entity, and each changed field's old and new value.","id":"REQ-52","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-8","Q-4"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Audit entries exist","id":"AC-53.1","level":"api","then":"The admin gets 200 with entries filterable by entity and date range; staff and Buyer get 403","when":"An admin, a staff user and a Buyer request the audit history"}],"ears":"The portal shall allow only administrators to view audit history.","id":"REQ-53","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-8","Q-4"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Invoices in October: A net 100 (P x10), A net 50 (Q x5), C net 30 (P x3)","id":"AC-54.1","level":"api","then":"Sales by period shows 180 for October; by customer shows A 150, C 30; top products ranks P (13 units, 130) above Q (5 units, 50)","when":"Staff request each report for 1–31 Oct"},{"given":"The same data","id":"AC-54.2","level":"api","then":"The CSV contains the same rows as the on-screen report; the Buyer gets 403","when":"Staff export sales by customer as CSV; a Buyer requests any report"}],"ears":"When staff or an administrator requests the sales-by-period, sales-by-customer or top-products report for a date range, the portal shall return the figures on screen and as a CSV export, computed from net totals of invoices dated in that range.","id":"REQ-54","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-7","Q-7","ASM-21"]}],"suggestions":["Fix AC-17.2 wording before test authoring: with Tuesday as a non-working date, Monday 13:00 gives Wednesday and Friday 15:00 gives Wednesday (Monday is the next working day, Tuesday is skipped).","Confirm with Hamza that templates (Q-6) are really in the first release, because ASM-1 assumed they are out of scope.","Consider an email to staff when a stock import fails, as well as the dashboard indicator.","Consider letting staff filter the queue by requested delivery date as well as order date.","Consider a simple CSV import for vehicle compatibility data once the data source is known.","Consider showing the imported quantity, not just the status, so Buyers know why a large order is rejected under the Q-8 rule.","Consider payment method capture when marking invoices paid once the open point is decided."]},{"assumptions":["Where assumptions conflict, the later or answered one wins: ASM-30 'Price on request' over ASM-2; ASM-31 (tax added at one configurable rate on invoices) over ASM-3; ASM-35 (persistent basket per Buyer) over ASM-13; Q-8 (block quantities above last imported quantity) over ASM-7.","Order emails go to the Buyer who placed the order; for staff-created orders they go to the customer company's contact email.","Staff cancellation of a Confirmed or later order works the same as a rejection: a reason is required and the customer is emailed.","A product that has never appeared in a successful stock import is treated as Out of stock.","A stock file is invalid as a whole if it is missing, unreadable, lacks the identifier or quantity column, or has any quantity that is not a whole number ≥ 0; unknown identifiers alone do not invalidate it.","The delivery list includes every non-cancelled order with the chosen delivery date.","Sales reports are based on invoice net amounts, dated by invoice date.","Supported product image formats are JPEG, PNG and WebP, up to 5 MB.","Staff may change delivery date, address, quantities, lines and note on any Received order; delivery-date and address rules from checkout still apply.","Hosting is a single cloud region in the client's cloud account (ASM-24)."],"nfrs":[{"id":"NFR-1","metric":"p95 response time ≤ 1.5 s at 50 concurrent users","text":"Catalogue search, category filter and vehicle search respond within the target with 50,000 active products."},{"id":"NFR-2","metric":"100,000-row CSV imported in ≤ 10 minutes","text":"The nightly stock import completes within the target for a large file."},{"id":"NFR-3","metric":"bcrypt cost ≥ 12 or Argon2id with ≥ 64 MB memory; 0 plaintext passwords in storage or logs","text":"Passwords are stored only as salted adaptive hashes."},{"id":"NFR-4","metric":"100% of endpoints served over TLS 1.2 or higher; plain HTTP requests redirected (301)","text":"All traffic uses encrypted transport."},{"id":"NFR-5","metric":"Session invalid after 8 hours of inactivity","text":"Idle sessions expire."},{"id":"NFR-6","metric":"p95 PDF download ≤ 3 s for invoices up to 200 lines","text":"Invoice PDFs are generated within the target."},{"id":"NFR-7","metric":"≥ 99.5% monthly uptime","text":"Portal availability during business operation."},{"id":"NFR-8","metric":"≥ 99% of emails handed to the mail provider within 2 minutes","text":"Order and invoice emails are dispatched promptly after the triggering status change."},{"id":"NFR-9","metric":"Retention ≥ 7 years; 0 records removed on deactivation","text":"Audit entries, orders and invoices are retained and never deleted by user deactivation."}],"outOfScope":["Customer Account Manager role (Q-1)","Saved basket templates, section 16 (ASM-1)","Customer creation or editing of delivery addresses (Q-5)","Backorders and ordering quantities above the last imported stock quantity (Q-8)","Online card payments and recording payment method","Route planning for deliveries","SMS or push notifications (ASM-15)","Social or single sign-on (ASM-36)","Migration of existing customers, products, price lists and users; system starts empty with seed data (ASM-23)","Volume, promotional, discount and effective-dated pricing","Multiple currencies (ASM-4)","Nested categories (ASM-19)","Custom report builder (ASM-21)","Writing stock changes back to the ERP or decrementing stock on order","A separate Rejected order status (ASM-38)","Reproducing an existing client invoice template"],"requirements":[{"acceptance":[{"given":"An active Buyer account with email buyer@a.test and password P","id":"AC-1.1","level":"api","then":"Response is 200 and a session is returned; GET /orders with that session returns 200","when":"POST /auth/sign-in with buyer@a.test and P"},{"given":"An active Buyer account with email buyer@a.test","id":"AC-1.2","level":"api","then":"Both responses are 401 with the same message 'Invalid email or password' and no session is returned","when":"POST /auth/sign-in with buyer@a.test and a wrong password, and separately with unknown@a.test"}],"ears":"When a user submits an email address and password that match an active account, the portal shall start an authenticated session for that user's role.","id":"REQ-1","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","ASM-36"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An active account with 4 consecutive failed sign-ins","id":"AC-2.1","level":"api","then":"The correct-password attempt is rejected with 423 and a message stating the account is temporarily locked","when":"A 5th sign-in with a wrong password is made, then a sign-in with the correct password 1 minute later"},{"given":"An account locked at time T","id":"AC-2.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 200 and the failed-attempt count is reset to 0","when":"A sign-in with the correct password is made at T+15 minutes"},{"given":"An account with 4 consecutive failed sign-ins","id":"AC-2.3","level":"api","then":"The final correct sign-in succeeds (the count was reset by the success)","when":"A successful sign-in occurs, followed by 4 more failed attempts and then a correct sign-in"}],"ears":"If an account reaches 5 consecutive failed sign-in attempts, then the portal shall lock the account for 15 minutes and reject every sign-in attempt during the lock with a 'temporarily locked' message.","id":"REQ-2","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","ASM-5"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An active account","id":"AC-3.1","level":"api","then":"The reset succeeds, sign-in with the new password returns 200, sign-in with the old password returns 401, and reusing the token returns 400","when":"POST /auth/password-reset is called, and the emailed token is used within 1 hour to set a new password"},{"given":"A reset token issued at time T","id":"AC-3.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 400 'link expired' and the password is unchanged","when":"The token is used at T+61 minutes"},{"given":"No account exists for unknown@a.test","id":"AC-3.3","level":"api","then":"Response is identical to that for an existing email and no email is sent","when":"POST /auth/password-reset with unknown@a.test"},{"given":"An account locked 5 minutes ago","id":"AC-3.4","level":"api","then":"The reset email is sent and the password changes, but sign-in with the new password is still rejected with 423 until 15 minutes after the lock began","when":"A password reset is requested and completed"}],"ears":"When a user requests a password reset for an email address of an existing account, the portal shall email a single-use reset link that expires 1 hour after it is issued.","id":"REQ-3","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","ASM-16","ASM-17"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A signed-in Buyer session","id":"AC-4.1","level":"api","then":"The second request returns 401","when":"POST /auth/sign-out, then GET /orders with the same session"}],"ears":"When a signed-in user signs out, the portal shall invalidate that user's session.","id":"REQ-4","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An admin invites new.buyer@a.test as Buyer of company A","id":"AC-5.1","level":"api","then":"The account status becomes Active and sign-in with that password returns 200","when":"The invitee uses the emailed link within 7 days to set a password"},{"given":"An invitation issued at time T","id":"AC-5.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 400 'invitation expired' and the account stays Invited","when":"The link is used at T+7 days+1 minute"},{"given":"An expired invitation","id":"AC-5.3","level":"api","then":"A new email is sent with a link valid for 7 days and the previous link returns 400","when":"The admin resends the invitation"},{"given":"An admin","id":"AC-5.4","level":"api","then":"Response is 400 because the role does not exist","when":"The admin tries to invite a user with role 'Customer Account Manager'"}],"ears":"When an administrator invites a Customer Buyer for a customer company or an Office Staff user, the portal shall email an invitation link that is valid for 7 days and that activates the account once the invitee sets a password.","id":"REQ-5","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-17","Q-1","ASM-16"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Buyer deactivated by an admin, who has 3 past orders","id":"AC-6.1","level":"api","then":"Response is 403 'account inactive', and staff can still open all 3 orders","when":"The Buyer attempts to sign in"},{"given":"A Buyer with an open session whose company is then set inactive, and the company has an order in Received","id":"AC-6.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 403, no order is created, and the existing order stays in Received","when":"The Buyer submits a checkout"},{"given":"A deactivated user","id":"AC-6.3","level":"api","then":"Sign-in returns 200","when":"An admin reactivates the user and the user signs in"}],"ears":"If a user is deactivated or belongs to an inactive customer company, then the portal shall reject that user's sign-in and order submission while keeping the user's and company's orders and invoices unchanged.","id":"REQ-6","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-17","ASM-18","ASM-34"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Users in roles Buyer, Office Staff and Administrator","id":"AC-7.1","level":"api","then":"Each user is returned with role, company (Buyers only) and status Invited, Active, Locked or Deactivated","when":"An admin calls GET /admin/users"},{"given":"A Buyer of company A","id":"AC-7.2","level":"api","then":"Only company B's orders are returned","when":"An admin moves the Buyer to company B and the Buyer then lists orders"},{"given":"An Office Staff user","id":"AC-7.3","level":"api","then":"Response is 403","when":"The staff user calls PATCH /admin/users/{id}"}],"ears":"The portal shall allow administrators to list users with role, customer company and account status, change a user's role, change a user's customer company, and deactivate or reactivate a user.","id":"REQ-7","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-17"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Buyer X of company A and an order and invoice of company B","id":"AC-8.1","level":"api","then":"Both responses are 404 and no company B data is returned","when":"Buyer X requests GET /orders/{B order id} and GET /invoices/{B invoice id}"},{"given":"Company A has orders placed by Buyer X, Buyer Y and by office staff","id":"AC-8.2","level":"api","then":"All three orders are returned","when":"Buyer X lists orders"},{"given":"A signed-in Buyer","id":"AC-8.3","level":"api","then":"Response is 403","when":"The Buyer calls a staff endpoint such as GET /staff/orders or an admin endpoint"}],"ears":"The portal shall restrict each Customer Buyer to the orders, invoices, prices, delivery addresses and account details of the Buyer's own customer company.","id":"REQ-8","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-9","Q-1","Q-2"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Active products 'Brake Pad Set' (code BP-1001, MPN 0986494, brand Bosch) and a retired product 'Brake Disc'","id":"AC-9.1","level":"api","then":"Each search returns 'Brake Pad Set' and none returns the retired product","when":"A Buyer searches 'brake', 'bp-10', '98649' and 'bosch'"}],"ears":"When a customer searches the catalogue with a text term, the portal shall return the active products whose name, distributor product code, manufacturer part number or brand contains the term, ignoring letter case.","id":"REQ-9","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-10"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Active products in categories Filters and Brake system","id":"AC-10.1","level":"api","then":"The first list contains only Filters products; the second contains products of both categories","when":"A Buyer lists the catalogue filtered by Filters, then lists without a category filter"},{"given":"Categories Filters (active) and Exhaust (retired)","id":"AC-10.2","level":"api","then":"Only Filters is returned","when":"A Buyer requests the category list"}],"ears":"When a customer filters the catalogue by a category, the portal shall return only active products assigned to that category.","id":"REQ-10","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-10","ASM-19","ASM-37"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P compatible with Ford Focus 2018 1.0 EcoBoost Petrol Titanium, and product Q compatible with Ford Focus 2018 Diesel","id":"AC-11.1","level":"api","then":"P is returned and Q is not","when":"A Buyer searches make Ford, model Focus, year 2018, fuel type Petrol"},{"given":"The same products","id":"AC-11.2","level":"api","then":"Both P and Q are returned","when":"A Buyer searches make Ford, model Focus only"}],"ears":"When a customer searches by vehicle using any of make, model, year, engine, fuel type and variant, the portal shall return only active products that have a compatibility record matching every selected value.","id":"REQ-11","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-10","ASM-20"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An active product with all fields populated and 2 compatibility records","id":"AC-12.1","level":"api","then":"The list item has image URL, name, code, manufacturer, unit, pack size, price and stock status; the detail additionally has description and both compatibility records","when":"A Buyer calls GET /catalogue and GET /catalogue/{id}"},{"given":"An active product whose stock status is Out of stock","id":"AC-12.2","level":"api","then":"The product is returned with stock status 'Out of stock'","when":"A Buyer opens its detail"}],"ears":"The portal shall return for each catalogue product the image, name, distributor product code, manufacturer, unit of sale, pack size, the requesting customer's price and stock status, and on the product detail additionally the description and vehicle compatibility list.","id":"REQ-12","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3","I-10"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P priced 40.00 on Standard (assigned to company A) and 35.00 on Fleet (assigned to company B)","id":"AC-13.1","level":"api","then":"Buyer of A sees 40.00 and Buyer of B sees 35.00, each in the configured single currency and marked excluding tax","when":"A Buyer of A and a Buyer of B each GET /catalogue/{P}"}],"ears":"When a Buyer views a product, the portal shall show the price excluding tax from the active price list assigned to the Buyer's customer company.","id":"REQ-13","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-11","ASM-31","ASM-4"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P has no price on company A's price list","id":"AC-14.1","level":"api","then":"P is shown with 'Price on request' and the add returns 422","when":"A Buyer of A views P and calls POST /basket/lines for P"},{"given":"Company A's assigned price list is deactivated","id":"AC-14.2","level":"api","then":"Every product shows 'Price on request'","when":"A Buyer of A lists the catalogue"}],"ears":"If a product has no price on the customer company's assigned price list or that price list is deactivated, then the portal shall show the product as 'Price on request' and reject adding it to the basket.","id":"REQ-14","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-11","ASM-30"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An admin creates price list 'Dealer', sets P to 50.00 and assigns it to company C","id":"AC-15.1","level":"api","then":"The price shown is 50.00","when":"A Buyer of C views P"},{"given":"Price list 'Dealer' already has a price for P","id":"AC-15.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 409 and the existing price is unchanged","when":"The admin adds a second price for P on 'Dealer'"},{"given":"An Office Staff user","id":"AC-15.3","level":"api","then":"Response is 403","when":"The staff user calls PUT /admin/price-lists/{id}/prices/{P}"}],"ears":"The portal shall allow administrators to create, rename and deactivate price lists, add, edit and remove one price per product on a price list, and assign a price list to a customer company.","id":"REQ-15","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-11","I-17"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Low-stock threshold 5","id":"AC-16.1","level":"unit","then":"It returns Out of stock, Low stock, Low stock and In stock","when":"StockStatusResolver.statusFor is called with quantities 0, 1, 5 and 6"},{"given":"A product that has never appeared in a successful import","id":"AC-16.2","level":"unit","then":"It returns Out of stock","when":"StockStatusResolver.statusFor is called with no quantity"}],"ears":"The portal shall derive each product's stock status from its last imported quantity as Out of stock at 0, Low stock from 1 up to and including the configured low-stock threshold, and In stock above the threshold.","id":"REQ-16","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-12","ASM-6","ASM-27"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Products BP-1001 (qty 10) and OF-200 (qty 0); a CSV with rows BP-1001,3 / OF-200,25 / XX-999,7 in the configured location","id":"AC-17.1","level":"job","then":"BP-1001 has qty 3, OF-200 has qty 25, an import log row has status Success and lists XX-999 as skipped","when":"The import job runs"},{"given":"A successful import has run","id":"AC-17.2","level":"job","then":"No data is written to the ERP and the CSV content is the only source of the new quantities","when":"The job finishes"}],"ears":"When the scheduled stock import job finds a valid ERP CSV in the configured file location, the portal shall replace the imported quantity of every product whose identifier matches a row, skip rows with unknown identifiers, and record a successful import with the list of skipped identifiers.","id":"REQ-17","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12","ASM-8","ASM-9","ASM-33"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"BP-1001 has qty 10 from the last successful import; the new CSV has a row BP-1001,-4","id":"AC-18.1","level":"job","then":"BP-1001 still has qty 10 and an import log row has status Failed with a reason naming the invalid row","when":"The import job runs"},{"given":"A failed import log row exists","id":"AC-18.2","level":"api","then":"The failed import is returned with its time and reason; the same call by a Buyer returns 403","when":"An Office Staff user calls GET /staff/stock-imports"}],"ears":"If the stock import file is missing, unreadable, lacks the product identifier or quantity column, or contains a quantity that is not a whole number of 0 or more, then the import job shall keep all previously imported quantities and record a failed import with the reason, visible to office staff and administrators.","id":"REQ-18","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12","I-6"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P last imported quantity 5, and two earlier orders of 4 each for P since that import","id":"AC-19.1","level":"api","then":"The order is accepted (earlier orders are not subtracted)","when":"A Buyer checks out 5 of P"},{"given":"Product P last imported quantity 5","id":"AC-19.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 422 naming P with available quantity 5 and no order is created","when":"A Buyer checks out 6 of P"},{"given":"A Received order with 6 of P, and the latest import set P to 5","id":"AC-19.3","level":"api","then":"Response is 422 naming P and the order stays Received","when":"Staff confirm the order"}],"ears":"If any line quantity exceeds the product's last imported quantity when a Buyer submits checkout, staff submit an order, or staff confirm an order, then the portal shall reject the action and identify each exceeding line.","id":"REQ-19","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-13","I-14","Q-8"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Buyer with an empty basket and P priced 12.50","id":"AC-20.1","level":"api","then":"The basket has 1 line: P, qty 4, unit price 12.50, line total 50.00, subtotal 50.00","when":"The Buyer adds 4 of P, signs out, signs in on another device and GETs /basket"},{"given":"A basket line for P","id":"AC-20.2","level":"api","then":"Both updates return 400 and the line is unchanged","when":"The Buyer sets quantity 0 and then 2.5"},{"given":"A Buyer has checked out a basket","id":"AC-20.3","level":"api","then":"The basket is empty","when":"The Buyer GETs /basket"}],"ears":"The portal shall keep one saved basket per Buyer, allowing products to be added, quantities changed to whole numbers of 1 or more, and lines removed, showing each line's unit price and line total and the basket subtotal, until the Buyer checks out or empties it.","id":"REQ-20","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","ASM-35"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Cutoff 14:00, timezone Europe/London, no extra non-working dates","id":"AC-21.1","level":"unit","then":"It returns Tuesday, Wednesday and Wednesday","when":"DeliveryDateCalculator.earliestDate is called for Monday 13:00, Monday 14:00 and Monday 15:00"},{"given":"Cutoff 14:00 and Tuesday listed as a non-working date","id":"AC-21.2","level":"unit","then":"It returns Wednesday and the following Tuesday respectively","when":"earliestDate is called for Monday 13:00 and for Friday 15:00"},{"given":"Cutoff 14:00, timezone Europe/London","id":"AC-21.3","level":"unit","then":"It returns the second working day","when":"earliestDate is called for an instant that is 13:30 in UTC and 14:30 in London"}],"ears":"The portal shall calculate the earliest delivery date as the next working day for orders placed before the configured cutoff time and as the second working day for orders placed at or after it, in the configured timezone, where working days exclude Saturdays, Sundays and admin-listed non-working dates.","id":"REQ-21","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","ASM-11","ASM-27","ASM-28"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Order time Monday 15:00, cutoff 14:00, maximum 30 days ahead","id":"AC-22.1","level":"api","then":"Each returns 422 with a delivery-date error and no order is created","when":"A Buyer checks out with Tuesday, with Saturday, and with a working day 31 days ahead"},{"given":"The same settings","id":"AC-22.2","level":"api","then":"The order is created","when":"A Buyer checks out with Wednesday"}],"ears":"If a submitted delivery date is not a working day, is before the earliest delivery date, or is more than the configured maximum number of days after the order time, then the portal shall reject the order submission.","id":"REQ-22","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","ASM-12","ASM-29"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A has addresses A1 and A2; company B has B1","id":"AC-23.1","level":"api","then":"Response is 422 and no order is created","when":"A Buyer of A checks out with B1"},{"given":"A signed-in Buyer","id":"AC-23.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 403","when":"The Buyer calls POST or PATCH on a delivery address endpoint"}],"ears":"The portal shall let Buyers select a delivery address only from the delivery addresses maintained by staff or administrators for the Buyer's own customer company.","id":"REQ-23","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","Q-5"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The last order number is ORD-000122 and a valid basket of 2 lines","id":"AC-24.1","level":"api","then":"Order ORD-000123 is created with status Received, both lines with unit prices, the address, date and note, and it appears in GET /staff/orders","when":"The Buyer submits checkout with a note 'Rear entrance'"},{"given":"Order ORD-000123 has P at 40.00","id":"AC-24.2","level":"api","then":"ORD-000123 still shows P at 40.00 and its total is unchanged","when":"An admin changes P's price on the company's price list to 45.00"},{"given":"A basket line for P added at 40.00, after which the price list sets P to 42.00","id":"AC-24.3","level":"api","then":"The review shows 42.00 and the created order stores 42.00","when":"The Buyer requests the checkout review and then submits"}],"ears":"When a Buyer submits a checkout that passes stock, price, address and delivery-date validation, the portal shall create an order numbered ORD- followed by a zero-padded sequence number, in status Received, storing each line's quantity and current unit price, the delivery address, delivery date and optional note, and empty the basket.","id":"REQ-24","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","I-4","I-13","ASM-22"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An order placed by Buyer X and confirmed by staff user S","id":"AC-25.1","level":"api","then":"The timeline lists Received by X and Confirmed by S, each with a timestamp, in time order","when":"GET /orders/{id}"}],"ears":"When an order's status changes, the portal shall add a timeline entry with the new status, the date and time, and the user or 'system' that made the change.","id":"REQ-25","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-8","I-14"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An order in Confirmed","id":"AC-26.1","level":"api","then":"Response is 200 and status is Picking","when":"Staff set it to Picking"},{"given":"An order in Confirmed","id":"AC-26.2","level":"api","then":"Both return 409 and the status stays Confirmed","when":"Staff set it to Out for delivery, and separately to Received"}],"ears":"When office staff change an order's status, the portal shall accept only a move to the next status in the sequence Received, Confirmed, Picking, Out for delivery, Delivered, or a cancellation.","id":"REQ-26","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","Q-3"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Received order of an active company with sufficient stock","id":"AC-27.1","level":"api","then":"Status is Confirmed and the timeline shows Confirmed by S with a timestamp","when":"Staff user S confirms it"},{"given":"A Received order whose company was set inactive","id":"AC-27.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 422 and the order stays Received","when":"Staff confirm it"}],"ears":"When office staff confirm a Received order whose customer company is active and whose lines pass the stock check, the portal shall set the order to Confirmed and record the confirming user and time.","id":"REQ-27","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","I-4"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An order by Buyer X where staff changed P from 10 to 8 before confirming","id":"AC-28.1","level":"api","then":"One email goes to Buyer X containing the order number, lines, total, and 'P: 10 → 8'","when":"Staff confirm the order"},{"given":"A staff-created order for company A","id":"AC-28.2","level":"api","then":"The confirmation email goes to company A's contact email","when":"Staff confirm it"}],"ears":"When an order becomes Confirmed, the portal shall email the order recipient a confirmation containing the order number, lines, quantities, unit prices, total, delivery address, delivery date, and every quantity change or line removal made by staff.","id":"REQ-28","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","I-5","ASM-15","ASM-25"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An order in Out for delivery","id":"AC-29.1","level":"api","then":"Status is Cancelled, the timeline shows the staff user, time and reason, and the recipient receives a cancellation email with the reason","when":"Staff cancel it with reason 'Customer request by phone'"},{"given":"An order in Received","id":"AC-29.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 400 and status stays Received","when":"Staff cancel it without a reason"},{"given":"An order in Delivered","id":"AC-29.3","level":"api","then":"Response is 409 and status stays Delivered","when":"Staff cancel it with a reason"}],"ears":"When office staff cancel an order that is not Delivered and provide a reason, the portal shall set the order to Cancelled, record the reason, user and time, and email the order recipient that the order was cancelled with the reason.","id":"REQ-29","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","Q-3","ASM-14","ASM-26","ASM-38"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Received order with P qty 10","id":"AC-30.1","level":"api","then":"The order shows P qty 8 with a recalculated total, and the order's amendment history records S, the time, and 10 → 8","when":"Staff user S sets P to 8"},{"given":"A Confirmed order","id":"AC-30.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 409 and the order is unchanged","when":"Staff change a line quantity"},{"given":"A Received order","id":"AC-30.3","level":"api","then":"Response is 422 and the date is unchanged","when":"Staff set the delivery date to a Saturday"}],"ears":"While an order is Received, the portal shall allow office staff to change line quantities, remove lines, change the delivery date, change the delivery address to another of the company's addresses, and edit the note, recording each change with user, time, and old and new values.","id":"REQ-30","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","I-8","ASM-21"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Received order by Buyer X with P qty 10 and Q qty 2","id":"AC-31.1","level":"api","then":"Buyer X receives an email listing 'P: 10 → 8' and 'Q: 2 → removed'","when":"Staff set P to 8 and remove Q"},{"given":"A Received order","id":"AC-31.2","level":"api","then":"No amendment email is sent","when":"Staff change only the note"}],"ears":"When office staff change a line quantity or remove a line on a Received order, the portal shall email the order recipient listing each changed line with its old and new quantity.","id":"REQ-31","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","ASM-25"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An order ORD-000123 in Picking placed by Buyer X","id":"AC-32.1","level":"api","then":"Buyer X receives one email containing ORD-000123 and the text 'out for delivery'","when":"Staff set it to Out for delivery"}],"ears":"When an order becomes Out for delivery, the portal shall email the order recipient a message identifying the order number and stating that it is out for delivery.","id":"REQ-32","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-14","ASM-15"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Orders for companies A and B in statuses Received and Confirmed on 1 and 3 March","id":"AC-33.1","level":"api","then":"Only company A's Received orders dated 1 March are returned, each with the 6 listed fields","when":"Staff call GET /staff/orders?customer=A&status=Received&from=2026-03-01&to=2026-03-02"}],"ears":"The portal shall provide office staff an order queue listing order number, customer, order date, requested delivery date, order total and status, filterable by customer, order-date range and status.","id":"REQ-33","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6","I-4"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A on price list Fleet with P at 35.00","id":"AC-34.1","level":"api","then":"An order in Received is created at 35.00, marked created by S, and appears in GET /orders for any Buyer of A","when":"Staff user S submits an order for A with 2 of P to address A1 for a valid date"},{"given":"Company A","id":"AC-34.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 422","when":"Staff submit an order for A using company B's address"}],"ears":"When office staff submit an order on behalf of an active customer company, the portal shall create the order with that company's prices, the stock, address and delivery-date rules of checkout, and a record of the staff user who created it.","id":"REQ-34","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","I-14","I-6"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Three orders due 5 March (Confirmed, Out for delivery, Cancelled) and one due 6 March","id":"AC-35.1","level":"api","then":"The response is text/csv with a header row and exactly 2 data rows with the listed columns","when":"Staff call GET /staff/delivery-list.csv?date=2026-03-05"}],"ears":"When office staff export the delivery list for a date, the portal shall return a CSV with one row per non-cancelled order due on that date containing order number, customer name, delivery address, contact person, contact phone, delivery date, line summary, note and status.","id":"REQ-35","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"2 Received, 1 Picking, 1 order due today, 3 unpaid invoices of which 1 overdue, and a failed latest import","id":"AC-36.1","level":"api","then":"The response contains received=2, picking=1, dueToday=1, unpaid=3, overdue=1, latestImportFailed=true","when":"Staff call GET /staff/dashboard"}],"ears":"The portal shall show office staff a dashboard with counts of orders in Received, Confirmed, Picking and Out for delivery, orders due for delivery today, unpaid and overdue invoices, and whether the latest stock import failed.","id":"REQ-36","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6","I-12"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A has 3 orders dated 1, 2 and 3 March, one staff-created","id":"AC-37.1","level":"api","then":"All 3 are returned in order 3, 2, 1 March, each with the 6 listed fields","when":"A Buyer of A calls GET /orders"}],"ears":"The portal shall list for a Buyer every order of the Buyer's customer company with order number, order date, delivery date, delivery address, total and status, newest first.","id":"REQ-37","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-15","Q-1"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An order with 2 lines, a note and one staff quantity amendment","id":"AC-38.1","level":"api","then":"All listed fields are present, including the amendment with old and new quantity","when":"A Buyer of the same company calls GET /orders/{id}"}],"ears":"When a user opens an order they are permitted to see, the portal shall return the order number, order date, customer, delivery address, requested delivery date, current status, status timeline, lines with quantity, unit price and line total, order total, note and staff amendments.","id":"REQ-38","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-15"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An order of company A in Received","id":"AC-39.1","level":"api","then":"Status becomes Cancelled and the timeline records the Buyer and time","when":"A Buyer of A cancels it"},{"given":"An order of company A in Confirmed","id":"AC-39.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 409 with a message to contact the distributor office and status stays Confirmed","when":"A Buyer of A cancels it"}],"ears":"If a Buyer tries to cancel an order that is not in Received, then the portal shall reject the cancellation with a message to contact the distributor office.","id":"REQ-39","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-15"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A past order with P (now priced 45.00, was 40.00), R (retired) and S (Out of stock)","id":"AC-40.1","level":"api","then":"The basket contains P at 45.00 with the original quantity, the response flags R and S as unavailable, and the company's order count is unchanged","when":"The Buyer calls POST /orders/{id}/repeat"}],"ears":"When a Buyer repeats a previous order, the portal shall add to the Buyer's basket each line whose product is active, priced on the current price list and not Out of stock, at the current price and original quantity, and return the other lines flagged as unavailable, without creating an order.","id":"REQ-40","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-15"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An Out for delivery order with net total 100.00 and tax rate 20%","id":"AC-41.1","level":"api","then":"One invoice is created with net 100.00, tax 20.00, total 120.00, status Unpaid and the order's lines and number","when":"Staff set it to Delivered"},{"given":"An order in Picking","id":"AC-41.2","level":"api","then":"No invoice exists for that order","when":"GET /invoices for its company"}],"ears":"When an order becomes Delivered, the portal shall create one invoice numbered INV- followed by a zero-padded sequence number, with customer, billing address, order number, invoice date, lines at the order's prices, net total, tax at the configured rate, gross total and status Unpaid.","id":"REQ-41","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-16","I-5","ASM-22","ASM-31"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Overdue days 30 and an unpaid invoice dated 1 March","id":"AC-42.1","level":"unit","then":"It returns Unpaid and Overdue","when":"InvoiceStatusResolver.statusFor is called for 31 March and 1 April"},{"given":"An invoice dated 1 January with a recorded payment","id":"AC-42.2","level":"unit","then":"It returns Paid","when":"statusFor is called for 1 April"}],"ears":"The portal shall report an invoice as Paid when a payment is recorded, as Overdue when unpaid more than the configured number of days after the invoice date, and otherwise as Unpaid.","id":"REQ-42","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-16","I-5","ASM-10","ASM-32"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A has 2 invoices and company B has 1","id":"AC-43.1","level":"api","then":"The Buyer gets A's 2 invoices; staff get all 3, each with the 5 listed fields","when":"A Buyer of A calls GET /invoices and staff call GET /staff/invoices"}],"ears":"The portal shall list for a Buyer every invoice of the Buyer's customer company, and for office staff and administrators every invoice, each with invoice number, invoice date, order number, total and payment status.","id":"REQ-43","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-16","Q-2"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Invoice INV-000045 of company A","id":"AC-44.1","level":"api","then":"Response is 200 with content type application/pdf and the extracted text contains INV-000045, the order number and the totals","when":"A Buyer of A calls GET /invoices/{id}/pdf"},{"given":"Invoice of company A","id":"AC-44.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 404","when":"A Buyer of company B requests its PDF"}],"ears":"When a Buyer of the invoiced company or an office staff user downloads an invoice, the portal shall return a PDF containing invoice number, customer, billing address, order number, invoice date, lines with quantity and price, net total, tax, gross total and payment status.","id":"REQ-44","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-16"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An Unpaid invoice","id":"AC-45.1","level":"api","then":"Status is Paid with payment date 2026-03-10 and recorded by S","when":"Staff user S marks it paid with date 2026-03-10"},{"given":"An Unpaid invoice","id":"AC-45.2","level":"api","then":"The staff call returns 400, the Buyer call returns 403, and the invoice stays Unpaid","when":"Staff mark it paid with no payment date, or a Buyer attempts to mark it paid"}],"ears":"When office staff mark an invoice as paid with a payment date, the portal shall record the payment date and the recording user and set the invoice to Paid.","id":"REQ-45","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-16"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product BP-1001 exists","id":"AC-46.1","level":"api","then":"Response is 409","when":"An admin creates another product with code BP-1001"},{"given":"Product P appears on a past order","id":"AC-46.2","level":"api","then":"P is absent from catalogue list and search results, and the past order still shows P's line","when":"An admin retires P"}],"ears":"The portal shall allow administrators to add, edit and retire products with name, unique distributor product code, manufacturer part number, manufacturer, description, category, unit of sale and pack size, keeping retired products out of the catalogue but visible on existing orders and invoices.","id":"REQ-46","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-10","I-17"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An admin","id":"AC-47.1","level":"api","then":"Filtering the catalogue by 'Cooling system' returns P","when":"The admin creates category 'Cooling system' and assigns product P to it"},{"given":"An admin","id":"AC-47.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 400","when":"The admin tries to create a category with a parent category"}],"ears":"The portal shall allow administrators to create, edit and retire single-level categories and to assign each product to one category.","id":"REQ-47","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-10","I-17","ASM-19","ASM-37"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P with image img1","id":"AC-48.1","level":"api","then":"Response is 200 and the catalogue shows the new image URL for P","when":"An admin uploads a 2 MB PNG for P"},{"given":"Product P","id":"AC-48.2","level":"api","then":"Both return 400 and P's image is unchanged","when":"An admin uploads a 6 MB JPEG, and separately a GIF"}],"ears":"When an administrator uploads a product image, the portal shall accept only JPEG, PNG or WebP files of at most 5 MB and replace the product's displayed image with the upload.","id":"REQ-48","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17","I-10"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P with no compatibility","id":"AC-49.1","level":"api","then":"P's detail lists both and a vehicle search for VW Golf returns P","when":"An admin adds records for Ford Focus 2018 Petrol and VW Golf 2019 Diesel"},{"given":"P has the VW Golf record","id":"AC-49.2","level":"api","then":"A vehicle search for VW Golf no longer returns P","when":"The admin removes it"}],"ears":"The portal shall allow administrators to add and remove vehicle compatibility records of make, model, year, engine, fuel type and variant for a product, with any number of records per product.","id":"REQ-49","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-10","I-17","ASM-20"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company with account number C-100 exists","id":"AC-50.1","level":"api","then":"Response is 409","when":"An admin creates another company with C-100"},{"given":"Company A","id":"AC-50.2","level":"api","then":"A Buyer of A sees 'Depot 2' among selectable addresses at checkout","when":"A staff user adds delivery address 'Depot 2' to A"},{"given":"Companies 'Smith Motors' and 'Fleetline'","id":"AC-50.3","level":"api","then":"Only 'Smith Motors' is returned","when":"Staff call GET /staff/customers?q=smith"}],"ears":"The portal shall allow administrators to create and edit customer companies with name, unique account number, primary contact, contact email, contact phone, billing address, assigned price list and active status, and allow office staff and administrators to add, edit and remove the company's delivery addresses.","id":"REQ-50","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17","I-6","Q-5"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Cutoff 14:00","id":"AC-51.1","level":"api","then":"The earliest date returned is Wednesday","when":"An admin sets cutoff 12:00 and a Buyer requests the earliest delivery date at Monday 13:00"},{"given":"An Office Staff user","id":"AC-51.2","level":"api","then":"Response is 403","when":"The staff user calls PUT /admin/settings"}],"ears":"The portal shall allow administrators to edit the order cutoff time, timezone, low-stock threshold, maximum delivery days ahead, overdue days, tax rate and the list of non-working dates.","id":"REQ-51","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17","ASM-5","ASM-27","ASM-28"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Invoices in March: company A net 300.00 (P qty 5), company B net 100.00 (Q qty 2)","id":"AC-52.1","level":"api","then":"Sales-by-customer shows A 300.00 and B 100.00; top-products lists P (qty 5) before Q (qty 2)","when":"Staff request sales-by-customer and top-products for 1–31 March"},{"given":"The same data","id":"AC-52.2","level":"api","then":"The CSV contains one row for March with net 400.00; the Buyer gets 403","when":"Staff request the sales-by-period CSV for March grouped by month, and a Buyer requests any report"}],"ears":"The portal shall provide office staff and administrators with sales-by-period, sales-by-customer and top-products reports over a chosen date range, each viewable on screen and exportable as CSV.","id":"REQ-52","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-7","Q-7","ASM-21"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P with name 'Brake Pad'","id":"AC-53.1","level":"api","then":"An audit entry exists for P with user M, a timestamp, field name, old 'Brake Pad' and new 'Brake Pad Set'","when":"Admin M renames it to 'Brake Pad Set'"},{"given":"An Unpaid invoice","id":"AC-53.2","level":"api","then":"An audit entry records S, the time, and status Unpaid → Paid and the payment date","when":"Staff user S marks it paid"}],"ears":"When an order, invoice, customer company, delivery address, user account, product, category, price list, price or compatibility record is created or changed, the portal shall record an audit entry with the acting user, the time, and each changed field's old and new values.","id":"REQ-53","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-8","Q-4"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Audit entries exist","id":"AC-54.1","level":"api","then":"The admin gets 200 with entries; the staff user and Buyer get 403","when":"An admin, a staff user and a Buyer each call GET /admin/audit"}],"ears":"If a user who is not an administrator requests audit history, then the portal shall reject the request.","id":"REQ-54","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-8","Q-4"]}],"suggestions":["Q-6 answered how saved basket templates are shared, which suggests the stakeholder may expect templates in this release. Confirm before following ASM-1, which excludes them.","Add date and status filters to the customer order history (the request recommends them but calls them an open point).","Add a confirmation step before a customer cancels an order.","Consider a Customer Account Manager role in a later release if larger customers need finer-grained visibility.","Consider bulk CSV import for vehicle compatibility data once the data source is known.","Record payment method on invoice payments once the client decides the options."]},{"assumptions":["Conflict resolved: ASM-30 ('Price on request', also for deactivated price lists) is used instead of ASM-2.","Conflict resolved: ASM-31 (prices excluding tax, invoices add tax at one configurable rate) is used instead of ASM-3.","Conflict resolved: ASM-35 (one saved basket per Buyer across sessions) is used instead of ASM-13.","Conflict resolved: the answer Q-8 (an ordered quantity must not exceed the last imported quantity) replaces ASM-7.","ASM-39: Order emails go to the Buyer who placed the order. For staff-created orders they go to the customer company's contact email.","ASM-40: Staff must give a reason for every staff cancellation, not only rejections, and the customer gets that reason by email.","ASM-41: Stock CSV rows are matched on the distributor product code, which is unique per product. A product that has never been imported counts as Out of stock.","ASM-42: Accepted product image types are JPEG, PNG and WebP, up to 5 MB each. A new upload replaces the previous image.","ASM-43: The delivery list covers the chosen date (today by default) and includes orders in Confirmed, Picking, Out for delivery or Delivered status, with the columns listed in REQ-37.","ASM-44: Sales reports are based on invoices by invoice date and use net amounts. 'Top products' means the top 20.","ASM-45: Repeating an order adds its lines to the Buyer's existing saved basket. If a product is already in the basket, the quantities are added together.","ASM-46: Invoice tax is worked out on the net total and rounded to 2 decimals, half-up.","Staff can create and confirm orders and change their status. Only Administrators manage catalogue, price lists, users and settings. Office Staff can also maintain delivery addresses (Q-5)."],"nfrs":[{"id":"NFR-1","metric":"p95 response time ≤ 1 s with 100,000 active products and 50 concurrent users","text":"Catalogue text, category and vehicle searches respond quickly enough for counter use."},{"id":"NFR-2","metric":"p95 response time ≤ 2 s at 50 concurrent users","text":"Basket, checkout, order list and order detail API calls respond within a bounded time."},{"id":"NFR-3","metric":"0 plaintext or reversibly encrypted passwords; argon2id or bcrypt with cost ≥ 12","text":"Passwords are stored only as salted hashes."},{"id":"NFR-4","metric":"100% of endpoints served over TLS 1.2 or higher; plain HTTP redirected","text":"All portal traffic is encrypted in transit."},{"id":"NFR-5","metric":"Idle timeout 30 minutes; absolute session lifetime 12 hours","text":"Sessions expire after inactivity."},{"id":"NFR-6","metric":"A 100,000-row CSV imports in ≤ 15 minutes","text":"The nightly stock import finishes before the business day."},{"id":"NFR-7","metric":"p95 PDF download time ≤ 5 s for an invoice of up to 200 lines","text":"Invoice PDFs are generated on request."},{"id":"NFR-8","metric":"≥ 99% of emails handed to the email service within 5 minutes of the event","text":"Order and invoice emails are sent soon after the triggering event."},{"id":"NFR-9","metric":"≥ 99.5% monthly availability, hosted in 1 cloud region (ASM-24)","text":"The portal is available during business use."},{"id":"NFR-10","metric":"0 WCAG 2.1 AA failures on sign-in, catalogue, product, basket, checkout, orders and invoices screens in an automated audit","text":"Customer screens are accessible."}],"outOfScope":["Customer Account Manager role (Q-1)","Saved basket templates, section 16 (ASM-1)","Customers creating or editing their own delivery addresses (Q-5)","Backorders and ordering beyond the last imported stock quantity (Q-8)","Online card payments and payment method capture","Writing stock changes back to the ERP or subtracting orders from stock between imports (Q-8)","Volume, promotional, discount and effective-dated pricing; multiple currencies (ASM-4)","SMS or push notifications; editable email templates (ASM-15)","Single sign-on or social sign-in (ASM-36)","Nested categories (ASM-37)","A separate Rejected order status (ASM-38)","Custom report builder (ASM-21)","Migration of existing customers, products, price lists and users; system starts empty with seed data (ASM-23)","Route planning for deliveries","Bulk import of vehicle compatibility data; admins enter it manually (ASM-20)","Reproducing an existing client invoice template"],"requirements":[{"acceptance":[{"given":"An active Customer Buyer of company A with password 'Correct#1'","id":"AC-1.1","level":"api","then":"The response is 200 with a session, and GET /me with that session returns role 'Customer Buyer' and company A","when":"POST /auth/sign-in is called with that email and 'Correct#1'"},{"given":"An active user account","id":"AC-1.2","level":"api","then":"Both calls return 401 with the same message 'Invalid email or password' and no session","when":"Sign-in is called once with a wrong password, and once with an email that is not registered"},{"given":"A signed-in user","id":"AC-1.3","level":"api","then":"Sign-out returns 200 and GET /me returns 401","when":"POST /auth/sign-out is called and then GET /me is called with the same session"}],"ears":"When a user submits an email address and password that match an active account, the portal shall start an authenticated session that carries the user's role and, for a Customer Buyer, the user's customer company.","id":"REQ-1","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","ASM-36"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An active account with 4 consecutive failed sign-ins","id":"AC-2.1","level":"api","then":"The correct sign-in succeeds and the account is not locked after the 4 later failures","when":"The correct password is submitted, and then 4 more wrong passwords are submitted"},{"given":"An account with 5 consecutive failed sign-ins made at 10:00","id":"AC-2.2","level":"api","then":"Sign-in is rejected with the temporary-lock message and no session is created","when":"The correct password is submitted at 10:14"},{"given":"An account locked at 10:00","id":"AC-2.3","level":"api","then":"Sign-in succeeds and the failed-attempt count starts again from 0","when":"The correct password is submitted at 10:15 or later"}],"ears":"If 5 consecutive sign-in attempts for one account fail, then the portal shall lock that account for 15 minutes and reject every sign-in attempt for it during that time with a message saying the account is temporarily locked.","id":"REQ-2","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","ASM-5"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A registered user and an unregistered email address","id":"AC-3.1","level":"api","then":"Both calls return the same 202 response; one reset email containing a link is sent to the email service for the registered user and none for the unregistered address","when":"POST /auth/password-reset is called for each"},{"given":"A reset link issued 30 minutes ago","id":"AC-3.2","level":"api","then":"The new password signs in, the old password returns 401, and the second use of the link is rejected as invalid","when":"The user sets new password 'NewPass#2' through the link, then signs in with the old and the new password, then uses the link again"},{"given":"A reset link issued 61 minutes ago","id":"AC-3.3","level":"api","then":"The request is rejected as expired and the password is unchanged","when":"The user tries to set a new password through it"},{"given":"An account locked 5 minutes ago","id":"AC-3.4","level":"api","then":"The reset email is sent and the password changes, but sign-in is rejected with the lock message until 15 minutes after the lock started","when":"The user requests a reset, sets a new password and immediately signs in with it"}],"ears":"When a user requests a password reset for their email address, the portal shall email that address a single-use reset link that is valid for 1 hour and lets the user set a new password.","id":"REQ-3","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","ASM-16","ASM-17","ASM-36"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An Administrator invites buyer@a.example as a Customer Buyer of company A","id":"AC-4.1","level":"api","then":"The account changes from Pending to Active and the invitee can sign in","when":"The invitee opens the emailed link 2 days later and sets a password"},{"given":"An invitation sent 7 days and 1 minute ago","id":"AC-4.2","level":"api","then":"The request is rejected as expired and the account stays Pending","when":"The invitee tries to set a password through its link"},{"given":"A Pending invitation","id":"AC-4.3","level":"api","then":"A new link is emailed with a new 7-day validity and the previous link is rejected as invalid","when":"The Administrator resends it"},{"given":"An Administrator","id":"AC-4.4","level":"api","then":"The request is rejected with 400 because the role does not exist","when":"The Administrator invites a user with role 'Customer Account Manager'"}],"ears":"When an Administrator invites a Customer Buyer or Office Staff user, the portal shall email the invitee a link, valid for 7 days, through which the invitee sets a password and the account becomes active.","id":"REQ-4","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-17","ASM-16","Q-1"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A deactivated Customer Buyer","id":"AC-5.1","level":"api","then":"Sign-in is rejected with an 'account inactive' message","when":"The Buyer signs in with the correct password"},{"given":"Company A with a Confirmed order, set to inactive by an Administrator","id":"AC-5.2","level":"api","then":"The Buyer's sign-in is rejected, and the order is still shown to staff with status Confirmed and all its lines","when":"A Buyer of company A signs in, and Office Staff open the Confirmed order"},{"given":"A Buyer with an open session who is then deactivated","id":"AC-5.3","level":"api","then":"The request returns 403 and no order is created","when":"The Buyer submits a checkout"},{"given":"A deactivated user","id":"AC-5.4","level":"api","then":"Sign-in succeeds","when":"An Administrator reactivates the user and the user signs in"}],"ears":"If a user has been deactivated or the user's customer company is inactive, then the portal shall reject that user's sign-in and order submissions while keeping the user's and company's existing orders, invoices and history unchanged.","id":"REQ-5","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-17","ASM-18","ASM-34"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Buyer X of company A and order O-B of company B","id":"AC-6.1","level":"api","then":"Each request returns 404 and no company B data is returned","when":"Buyer X requests the order detail, the invoice and the invoice PDF of company B"},{"given":"Company A with one order placed by Buyer X, one by Buyer Y, and one created by Office Staff","id":"AC-6.2","level":"api","then":"All 3 orders are returned and no orders of other companies are returned","when":"Buyer X lists orders"},{"given":"Buyer X of company A","id":"AC-6.3","level":"api","then":"The request returns 404","when":"Buyer X requests the delivery addresses or account details of company B by id"}],"ears":"The portal shall limit each Customer Buyer to the orders, invoices, prices, delivery addresses and account details of the Buyer's own customer company.","id":"REQ-6","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-5","Q-1"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A signed-in Customer Buyer","id":"AC-7.1","level":"api","then":"Each call returns 403 and no data changes","when":"The Buyer calls the staff order queue, marks an invoice paid, or requests a sales report"},{"given":"A signed-in Office Staff user","id":"AC-7.2","level":"api","then":"Each call returns 403 and no data changes","when":"The user creates a price list, invites a user, or reads the audit history"}],"ears":"If a user calls a function reserved for Office Staff or Administrators without holding the required role, then the portal shall refuse the request with a 403 error and make no change.","id":"REQ-7","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-6","I-17","Q-4","Q-7"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Active products 'Front Brake Pad Set' (code DP-1001, part number 0986494, brand Bosch) and 'Oil Filter' (code OF-200, brand Mann)","id":"AC-8.1","level":"api","then":"Each search returns 'Front Brake Pad Set' and none returns 'Oil Filter'","when":"The customer searches for 'brak', 'dp-10', '6494' and 'BOSCH'"},{"given":"A retired product named 'Brake Hose'","id":"AC-8.2","level":"api","then":"'Brake Hose' is not returned","when":"The customer searches for 'brake'"},{"given":"A result list","id":"AC-8.3","level":"api","then":"It contains image URL, name, product code, manufacturer, unit, pack size, the customer's price and stock status","when":"The customer reads a result row"}],"ears":"When a customer searches the catalogue with a text term, the portal shall return the active products whose name, distributor product code, manufacturer part number or brand contains the term, ignoring letter case.","id":"REQ-8","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-10"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Active products in categories 'Filters' and 'Brake system'","id":"AC-9.1","level":"api","then":"The lists contain only Filters products, then only Brake system products, then products of both categories","when":"The customer lists products with category 'Filters', then with 'Brake system', then with no category"},{"given":"Category 'Filters' with 'Oil Filter' and 'Air Filter'","id":"AC-9.2","level":"api","then":"Only 'Oil Filter' is returned","when":"The customer searches 'oil' with category 'Filters'"}],"ears":"When a customer selects a category filter, the portal shall list only active products assigned to that category, combined with any active text or vehicle search.","id":"REQ-9","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-10","ASM-37"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P with one compatibility record Ford / Focus / 2018 / 1.0 EcoBoost / Petrol / Titanium","id":"AC-10.1","level":"api","then":"P is returned","when":"The customer searches make Ford, model Focus, year 2018"},{"given":"The same product P","id":"AC-10.2","level":"api","then":"P is not returned","when":"The customer searches make Ford, model Focus, year 2005, or make Ford, model Focus, fuel type Diesel"}],"ears":"When a customer searches by vehicle using any combination of make, model, year, engine, fuel type and variant, the portal shall list the active products that have at least one compatibility record matching every value supplied.","id":"REQ-10","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-10","ASM-20"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An active product with 2 compatibility records and a price on the customer's price list","id":"AC-11.1","level":"api","then":"The response contains all listed fields, the customer's price and both vehicles","when":"The customer requests the product detail"},{"given":"An active product whose last imported quantity is 0","id":"AC-11.2","level":"api","then":"The product is returned with stock status 'Out of stock'","when":"The customer requests the product detail"}],"ears":"When a customer opens a product, the portal shall return the product's image, name, product code, manufacturer, description, unit, pack size, the customer's price, stock status and compatible vehicles.","id":"REQ-11","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-10"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P priced 10.00 on 'Standard' and 8.00 on 'Fleet'; company A assigned 'Standard', company B assigned 'Fleet'","id":"AC-12.1","level":"api","then":"The Buyer of A sees 10.00 and the Buyer of B sees 8.00, both marked excluding tax","when":"A Buyer of each company views P"},{"given":"The same set-up","id":"AC-12.2","level":"api","then":"The Buyer of A sees 8.00","when":"An Administrator reassigns company A to 'Fleet' and the Buyer of A views P again"}],"ears":"The portal shall show each customer, for every product, the price excluding tax taken from the price list assigned to the customer's company, in the single configured currency.","id":"REQ-12","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-11","ASM-4","ASM-31"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product Q with no price on company A's price list","id":"AC-13.1","level":"api","then":"Q is shown with 'Price on request' and the add call returns 422 with the basket unchanged","when":"A Buyer of A views Q and then adds Q to the basket"},{"given":"Company A's assigned price list is deactivated","id":"AC-13.2","level":"api","then":"Every product shows 'Price on request'","when":"A Buyer of A views any product"}],"ears":"If a product has no price on the customer's assigned price list or that price list is deactivated, then the portal shall show the product with 'Price on request' and refuse to add it to the basket.","id":"REQ-13","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-11","ASM-30"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Low-stock threshold 5","id":"AC-14.1","level":"unit","then":"The results are Out of stock, Low stock, Low stock, In stock and Out of stock","when":"The stock status is calculated for quantities 0, 1, 5 and 6, and for a product with no imported quantity"}],"ears":"The portal shall derive each product's stock status from its last imported quantity as 'Out of stock' at 0 or when never imported, 'Low stock' from 1 up to and including the low-stock threshold, and 'In stock' above the threshold.","id":"REQ-14","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-12","ASM-5","ASM-6","ASM-27","ASM-41"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Products DP-1 (quantity 3) and DP-2 (quantity 0); a CSV with rows DP-1=12, DP-2=4, XX-9=7","id":"AC-15.1","level":"job","then":"DP-1 is 12, DP-2 is 4, the log entry is Success with 2 applied, 1 skipped, skipped code XX-9","when":"The import job runs"},{"given":"A successful import","id":"AC-15.2","level":"job","then":"No outbound call or file is sent to the ERP","when":"The job finishes"}],"ears":"When the scheduled stock import job reads a valid ERP CSV file from the configured location, the portal shall replace the stock quantity of each product whose distributor product code matches a row, skip rows with unknown codes, and record an import log entry with the counts of applied and skipped rows and the skipped codes.","id":"REQ-15","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12","ASM-8","ASM-9","ASM-33","ASM-41"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"DP-1 has quantity 12 from the last import; the new CSV has DP-1=abc","id":"AC-16.1","level":"job","then":"DP-1 is still 12 and a Failed log entry names the invalid row","when":"The import job runs"},{"given":"No file is present in the configured location","id":"AC-16.2","level":"job","then":"All quantities are unchanged and a Failed log entry says the file is missing","when":"The import job runs"},{"given":"A failed import entry","id":"AC-16.3","level":"api","then":"Both see the failure, its time and reason","when":"Office Staff and an Administrator read the import log"}],"ears":"If the ERP CSV file is missing, unreadable, lacks a required column, or contains a non-numeric or negative quantity, then the stock import job shall keep all stock quantities from the previous successful import and record a failed import entry with the reason.","id":"REQ-16","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12","I-6"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Buyer adds 2 products to the basket and signs out","id":"AC-17.1","level":"api","then":"The basket holds the same 2 lines and quantities","when":"The Buyer signs in from a new session and reads the basket"},{"given":"A Buyer with a 2-line basket","id":"AC-17.2","level":"api","then":"The basket is empty afterwards","when":"The Buyer submits the order"},{"given":"Buyers X and Y of the same company","id":"AC-17.3","level":"api","then":"Y's basket is unchanged","when":"X adds a product to the basket"}],"ears":"The portal shall keep one saved basket per Customer Buyer across sessions and devices until the Buyer submits it as an order or empties it.","id":"REQ-17","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","ASM-35"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product A at 12.50 and product B at 3.00","id":"AC-18.1","level":"api","then":"Line totals are 50.00 and 6.00 and the subtotal is 56.00","when":"The Buyer adds A with quantity 4 and B with quantity 2"},{"given":"That basket","id":"AC-18.2","level":"api","then":"After removal the subtotal is 50.00, and quantity 0 is rejected with 422 leaving A at 4","when":"The Buyer removes B, then sets A's quantity to 0"}],"ears":"When a Buyer adds, changes the quantity of, or removes a basket line, the portal shall return each line's unit price, line total as unit price times quantity, and the basket subtotal excluding tax.","id":"REQ-18","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","I-3"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P with last imported quantity 10","id":"AC-19.1","level":"api","then":"The first order is created and the second is rejected with 422 listing P with available quantity 10","when":"A Buyer submits an order with P quantity 10, and another Buyer submits P quantity 11"},{"given":"Product P with last imported quantity 10 and an existing order for 8","id":"AC-19.2","level":"api","then":"The order is created, because orders since the import are not subtracted","when":"A Buyer submits a new order for P quantity 8 before the next import"},{"given":"Product R that is Out of stock","id":"AC-19.3","level":"api","then":"The submission is rejected listing R with available quantity 0","when":"A Buyer submits an order containing R quantity 1"}],"ears":"If a line in a submitted order asks for more than the product's quantity from the last successful stock import, then the portal shall refuse the submission and return each such line with the available quantity.","id":"REQ-19","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-13","Q-8"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Cutoff 14:00 and no extra non-working dates","id":"AC-20.1","level":"unit","then":"The results are Tuesday, Wednesday, Wednesday, the following Tuesday and the following Monday","when":"The earliest date is calculated for Monday 13:00, Monday 14:00, Monday 15:00, Friday 15:00 and Saturday 10:00"},{"given":"Cutoff 14:00 and Tuesday listed as a non-working date","id":"AC-20.2","level":"unit","then":"The result is Wednesday","when":"The earliest date is calculated for Monday 13:00"}],"ears":"The portal shall calculate the earliest delivery date, in the configured timezone, as the next working day for orders placed before the configured cutoff time and as the second working day after the order day for orders placed at or after the cutoff, where working days exclude weekends and admin-listed non-working dates.","id":"REQ-20","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","ASM-11","ASM-27","ASM-28"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Order time Monday 13:00, cutoff 14:00, maximum 30 days ahead","id":"AC-21.1","level":"api","then":"The first three are rejected with the rule named; Tuesday is accepted","when":"The Buyer selects Monday (same day), the coming Saturday, a date 31 days ahead, and Tuesday"}],"ears":"If a selected delivery date is not a working day, is before the earliest delivery date, or is more than the configured maximum number of days ahead, then the portal shall reject the selection with a message naming the broken rule.","id":"REQ-21","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","ASM-12","ASM-29"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A with 2 active and 1 deactivated delivery address","id":"AC-22.1","level":"api","then":"Only the 2 active addresses are returned","when":"A Buyer of A requests checkout addresses"},{"given":"A Buyer of company A","id":"AC-22.2","level":"api","then":"The checkout returns 422 and the create call returns 403","when":"The Buyer submits a checkout with an address id of company B, or calls the address create endpoint"}],"ears":"When a Buyer checks out, the portal shall offer as delivery addresses only the active addresses that Office Staff or Administrators maintain for the Buyer's company.","id":"REQ-22","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","Q-5"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The last order number is ORD-000122 and a valid basket of 2 lines","id":"AC-23.1","level":"api","then":"Order ORD-000123 is created with status Received, the 2 lines at current prices, the address, date and note, and the response returns the order number","when":"The Buyer submits with a valid address, date and note 'Rear door'"},{"given":"Order ORD-000123 with product P at 10.00","id":"AC-23.2","level":"api","then":"ORD-000123 still shows P at 10.00","when":"An Administrator changes P's price on that list to 12.00"},{"given":"Order ORD-000123 just submitted","id":"AC-23.3","level":"api","then":"ORD-000123 appears with status Received","when":"Office Staff read the order queue"},{"given":"A basket line whose product moved to 'Price on request' after it was added","id":"AC-23.4","level":"api","then":"The submission returns 422 naming that line and no order is created","when":"The Buyer submits"},{"given":"A Buyer in a browser with a 2-line basket","id":"AC-23.5","level":"ui","then":"Basket review, address selection, date selection, note and a final review showing lines, prices, total, address and date are shown before the submit button, and a confirmation page shows the order number","when":"The Buyer goes through checkout"}],"ears":"When a Buyer submits a checkout that passes stock, price, address and delivery date checks, the portal shall create an order with the next sequential ORD-prefixed number, status Received, the unit prices of the company's price list at that moment, the delivery address and date, and the optional note.","id":"REQ-23","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","I-4","I-13","ASM-22"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A past order with product A (now retired) qty 2 and product B qty 3 bought at 10.00, now priced 12.00","id":"AC-24.1","level":"api","then":"The basket gains B qty 3 at 12.00, the response flags A as no longer available, and the company's order count is unchanged","when":"The Buyer repeats the order"},{"given":"A basket already holding B qty 1","id":"AC-24.2","level":"api","then":"The basket holds B qty 4","when":"The Buyer repeats the same order"}],"ears":"When a Buyer repeats a previous order of their company, the portal shall add that order's still-orderable products to the Buyer's basket with the original quantities at current price-list prices and flag lines whose product is retired, Out of stock or without a price, without creating an order.","id":"REQ-24","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-15","ASM-45"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A with orders in January (Delivered) and March (Received)","id":"AC-25.1","level":"api","then":"The first returns only the March order and the second only the January order, each with all listed fields","when":"The Buyer lists orders filtered by March, and then by status Delivered"}],"ears":"When a Buyer lists orders, the portal shall return every order of the Buyer's company with order number, order date, delivery date, delivery address, total and status, filterable by order date range and status.","id":"REQ-25","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-15","Q-1"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Confirmed order whose line quantity staff changed from 5 to 3 before confirmation","id":"AC-26.1","level":"api","then":"All listed fields are returned, the timeline has Received and Confirmed entries, and the amendment shows quantity 5 changed to 3","when":"The Buyer opens the order"}],"ears":"When a Buyer opens an order of their company, the portal shall return the order number, order date, customer, delivery address, requested delivery date, current status, status timeline, lines with quantity, unit price and line total, order total, note and any staff amendments.","id":"REQ-26","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-15"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Received order of company A","id":"AC-27.1","level":"api","then":"The status is Cancelled and the timeline entry names the Buyer and time","when":"A Buyer of A cancels it"},{"given":"A Confirmed order of company A","id":"AC-27.2","level":"api","then":"The request returns 409 with a message to contact the distributor office and the status stays Confirmed","when":"A Buyer of A tries to cancel it"}],"ears":"While an order is in Received status, the portal shall let a Buyer of the order's company cancel it, recording the Buyer and time in the status timeline.","id":"REQ-27","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-15"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Orders of companies A and B in statuses Received and Picking","id":"AC-28.1","level":"api","then":"Only company A's Received orders are returned with all listed fields","when":"Office Staff filter by customer A and status Received"}],"ears":"The portal shall give Office Staff an order queue of all orders showing order number, customer, order date, requested delivery date, total and status, filterable by customer, order date range and status.","id":"REQ-28","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6","I-14"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Received order and a Confirmed order","id":"AC-29.1","level":"api","then":"Both requests return 409 and statuses are unchanged","when":"Staff set the Received order to Picking and the Confirmed order back to Received"},{"given":"A Picking order","id":"AC-29.2","level":"api","then":"Both changes succeed","when":"Staff set it to Out for delivery and then to Delivered"}],"ears":"When Office Staff change an order's status, the portal shall accept only the next status in the sequence Received, Confirmed, Picking, Out for delivery, Delivered.","id":"REQ-29","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","Q-3"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An order submitted by Buyer X, confirmed by staff user S1 and moved to Picking by S2","id":"AC-30.1","level":"api","then":"It holds 3 entries in order: Received by X, Confirmed by S1, Picking by S2, each with a timestamp","when":"The order timeline is read"}],"ears":"The portal shall record every order status change in the order's timeline with the new status, the timestamp and the user or system process that made it.","id":"REQ-30","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","I-8","I-5"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Received order placed by Buyer X with all lines in stock","id":"AC-31.1","level":"api","then":"Status is Confirmed with S1 and time recorded, and one confirmation email with the order number and lines is sent to Buyer X","when":"Staff user S1 confirms it"},{"given":"A Received order with product P quantity 8 and P's last imported quantity now 5","id":"AC-31.2","level":"api","then":"The request returns 409 naming P with available 5 and the status stays Received","when":"Staff confirm it"},{"given":"A Received order created by staff for company A","id":"AC-31.3","level":"api","then":"The confirmation email is sent to company A's contact email","when":"Staff confirm it"}],"ears":"When Office Staff confirm a Received order whose lines are all within the last imported stock quantities and whose customer company is active, the portal shall set the status to Confirmed, record the confirming user and time, and email an order confirmation listing the order number, lines, quantities, prices, delivery date, address and any staff quantity changes.","id":"REQ-31","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","Q-8","ASM-15","ASM-25","ASM-39"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An Out for delivery order","id":"AC-32.1","level":"api","then":"Status is Cancelled, the reason, user and time are stored, and an email with the reason is sent to the customer","when":"Staff cancel it with reason 'Customer request by phone'"},{"given":"A Received order","id":"AC-32.2","level":"api","then":"The request returns 400 and the status stays Received","when":"Staff reject it with no reason"},{"given":"A Delivered order","id":"AC-32.3","level":"api","then":"The request returns 409 and the status stays Delivered","when":"Staff try to cancel it"}],"ears":"When Office Staff cancel or reject an order that is not Delivered, the portal shall set it to Cancelled, store the required reason, the staff user and time, and email the customer the cancellation with the reason.","id":"REQ-32","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","Q-3","ASM-14","ASM-26","ASM-38","ASM-40"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Received order with P quantity 5","id":"AC-33.1","level":"api","then":"The order shows P quantity 3 and the new address, and the amendment history holds both changes with old and new values and the staff user","when":"Staff change P to 3 and set another of the company's addresses"},{"given":"A Confirmed order","id":"AC-33.2","level":"api","then":"The request returns 409 and the order is unchanged","when":"Staff try to change a quantity"},{"given":"A Received order","id":"AC-33.3","level":"api","then":"The request returns 422 and the order is unchanged","when":"Staff set a delivery date on a Saturday or an address of another company"}],"ears":"While an order is in Received status, the portal shall let Office Staff change line quantities, remove lines, and change the delivery date, delivery address and note, storing each change with its old and new values.","id":"REQ-33","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","I-8"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Received order placed by Buyer X with P quantity 5 and Q quantity 2","id":"AC-34.1","level":"api","then":"One email to Buyer X lists P 5 to 3 and Q 2 to 0","when":"Staff change P to 3 and remove Q"}],"ears":"When Office Staff change a line quantity or remove a line on a Received order, the portal shall email the customer a message listing each changed line with its old and new quantity.","id":"REQ-34","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","ASM-15","ASM-25","ASM-39"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Picking order ORD-000123 placed by Buyer X","id":"AC-35.1","level":"api","then":"One email naming ORD-000123 and stating it is out for delivery is sent to Buyer X","when":"Staff set it to Out for delivery"}],"ears":"When an order's status changes to Out for delivery, the portal shall email the customer a message with the order number saying the order is out for delivery.","id":"REQ-35","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-14","I-5","ASM-25","ASM-39"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A on price list 'Fleet' with P at 8.00","id":"AC-36.1","level":"api","then":"The order is Received with P at 8.00, created by S1, and appears in company A's Buyer order list","when":"Staff user S1 creates an order for A with P quantity 2, an address of A and a valid date"},{"given":"Staff creating an order for company A","id":"AC-36.2","level":"api","then":"The request returns 422 and no order is created","when":"They use an address of company B or a date before the earliest delivery date"}],"ears":"When Office Staff create an order on behalf of a customer company, the portal shall apply the same price, stock, address and delivery-date rules as customer checkout and record the staff user as the order's creator.","id":"REQ-36","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","I-14"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"For 12 May: one Confirmed, one Out for delivery, one Received and one Cancelled order; one Confirmed order for 13 May","id":"AC-37.1","level":"api","then":"The CSV has a header and exactly 2 rows (the Confirmed and Out for delivery orders) with all listed columns","when":"Staff export the delivery list for 12 May"}],"ears":"When Office Staff export the delivery list for a date, the portal shall return a CSV with one row per order for delivery that date in status Confirmed, Picking, Out for delivery or Delivered, with order number, customer, delivery address, contact name, contact phone, delivery date, line summary, note and status.","id":"REQ-37","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6","ASM-43"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"3 Received orders, 1 Picking order, 2 orders due today, 4 Unpaid and 1 Overdue invoice, and a failed latest import","id":"AC-38.1","level":"api","then":"It returns Received 3, Picking 1, due today 2, Unpaid 4, Overdue 1 and the latest import as Failed with its time","when":"Office Staff request the dashboard"}],"ears":"The portal shall show Office Staff and Administrators a dashboard with the counts of Received, Confirmed, Picking and Out for delivery orders, the number of orders due for delivery today, the number of Unpaid and Overdue invoices, and the result of the latest stock import.","id":"REQ-38","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6","I-12","I-16"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An Out for delivery order with lines 10.00 x 2 and 5.00 x 1, tax rate 20%, last invoice INV-000040","id":"AC-39.1","level":"api","then":"Invoice INV-000041 is created with net 25.00, tax 5.00, gross 30.00 and status Unpaid","when":"Staff set it to Delivered"},{"given":"Invoice INV-000041","id":"AC-39.2","level":"api","then":"INV-000041 still shows tax 5.00 and gross 30.00","when":"An Administrator changes the tax rate to 15%"}],"ears":"When an order's status becomes Delivered, the portal shall create one invoice with the next sequential INV-prefixed number, invoice date, customer, billing address, order number, lines with quantity and order-time unit price, net total, tax at the configured rate, gross total and status Unpaid.","id":"REQ-39","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-16","ASM-22","ASM-31","ASM-46"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Payment days 30 and an unpaid invoice dated 1 March","id":"AC-40.1","level":"unit","then":"It is Unpaid on 31 March and Overdue on 1 April","when":"The status is calculated on 31 March and on 1 April"},{"given":"An invoice dated 1 January marked paid","id":"AC-40.2","level":"unit","then":"It is Paid","when":"The status is calculated on 1 June"}],"ears":"The portal shall report an unpaid invoice as Overdue once more than the configured number of payment days have passed since its invoice date, and as Unpaid before that.","id":"REQ-40","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-16","I-5","ASM-10","ASM-32"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A with 2 invoices from orders placed by different Buyers and company B with 1 invoice","id":"AC-41.1","level":"api","then":"Both company A invoices are returned with all listed fields and the company B invoice is not","when":"A Buyer of A lists invoices"}],"ears":"When a Buyer lists invoices, the portal shall return every invoice of the Buyer's company with invoice number, order number, invoice date, gross total and payment status.","id":"REQ-41","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-16","Q-2"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Invoice INV-000041 of company A","id":"AC-42.1","level":"api","then":"Both receive content type application/pdf whose text contains INV-000041, the order number, each line, net 25.00, tax 5.00 and gross 30.00","when":"A Buyer of A and an Office Staff user download its PDF"}],"ears":"When a Buyer of the invoice's company or an Office Staff user downloads an invoice, the portal shall return a PDF with the invoice number, invoice date, customer, billing address, order number, lines with quantity, unit price and line total, net total, tax and gross total.","id":"REQ-42","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-16"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An Overdue invoice","id":"AC-43.1","level":"api","then":"The status is Paid with payment date 3 April and recorded by S1","when":"Staff user S1 marks it paid with payment date 3 April"},{"given":"An Unpaid invoice","id":"AC-43.2","level":"api","then":"The request returns 400 and the invoice stays Unpaid","when":"Staff mark it paid without a payment date"}],"ears":"When Office Staff mark an invoice as paid with a payment date, the portal shall set the invoice to Paid and store the payment date and the staff user who recorded it.","id":"REQ-43","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-16"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An Administrator","id":"AC-44.1","level":"api","then":"The first is created and the second returns 409","when":"The Administrator creates a product with code DP-1, then another product with code DP-1"},{"given":"Product P on a Delivered order and its invoice","id":"AC-44.2","level":"api","then":"P no longer appears in catalogue search, and the order detail and invoice still show P's line","when":"An Administrator retires P"}],"ears":"The portal shall let Administrators create, edit and retire products with name, internal ID, manufacturer part number, unique distributor product code, description, category, brand, unit of sale and pack size, keeping retired products on existing orders and invoices.","id":"REQ-44","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-10","I-17","ASM-41"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P with image img-1","id":"AC-45.1","level":"api","then":"Both uploads return 422 and P still shows img-1","when":"An Administrator uploads a 6 MB PNG and then a GIF"},{"given":"Product P with image img-1","id":"AC-45.2","level":"api","then":"The upload succeeds and the catalogue returns the new image URL for P","when":"An Administrator uploads a 1 MB PNG"}],"ears":"If an uploaded product image is not JPEG, PNG or WebP or is larger than 5 MB, then the portal shall reject the upload and keep the product's current image.","id":"REQ-45","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17","I-10","ASM-42"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An Administrator","id":"AC-46.1","level":"api","then":"The request returns 400 because categories have no parent","when":"The Administrator creates 'Exhaust' with a parent category"},{"given":"Category 'Exhaust' in use","id":"AC-46.2","level":"api","then":"'Exhaust' is not offered as a filter","when":"An Administrator retires it and a customer lists categories"}],"ears":"The portal shall let Administrators create, rename and retire single-level categories and assign each product to one category.","id":"REQ-46","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-10","I-17","ASM-19","ASM-37"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P with no compatibility records","id":"AC-47.1","level":"api","then":"The product detail lists the remaining record and vehicle search finds P only for that record","when":"An Administrator adds 2 records and removes 1"}],"ears":"The portal shall let Administrators add and remove any number of vehicle compatibility records per product, each holding make, model, model year, engine, fuel type and variant.","id":"REQ-47","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-10","I-17","ASM-20"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Price list 'Fleet' with P at 8.00","id":"AC-48.1","level":"api","then":"'Fleet' holds exactly one price for P, 9.00","when":"An Administrator sets P to 9.00 on 'Fleet'"},{"given":"Company A assigned 'Fleet'","id":"AC-48.2","level":"api","then":"A has only 'Dealer' assigned and its Buyers see 'Dealer' prices","when":"An Administrator assigns 'Dealer' to A"}],"ears":"The portal shall let Administrators create, rename and deactivate price lists, set, change and remove one price per product per list, and assign one price list to each customer company.","id":"REQ-48","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-11","I-17"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An Administrator","id":"AC-49.1","level":"api","then":"Company A is stored with the fields and its Buyers can no longer sign in","when":"The Administrator creates company A with all fields and then sets it inactive"}],"ears":"The portal shall let Administrators create and edit customer companies with name, account number, primary contact, contact email, contact phone, billing address, assigned price list and active status.","id":"REQ-49","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17","I-9"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A with no addresses","id":"AC-50.1","level":"api","then":"The address is stored with all fields and is no longer offered at checkout after deactivation","when":"Office Staff add an address and an Administrator deactivates it"}],"ears":"The portal shall let Office Staff and Administrators add, edit and deactivate the delivery addresses of a customer company, each with label, address lines, city, region, postal code, country, contact person and contact phone.","id":"REQ-50","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-17","Q-5"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Companies 'Smith Motors' (ACC-100) and 'Jones Fleet' (ACC-200)","id":"AC-51.1","level":"api","then":"The first returns only Smith Motors and the second only Jones Fleet, each with details, price list and status","when":"Staff search 'smith' and then 'ACC-2'"}],"ears":"When Office Staff search customers by name or account number, the portal shall return the matching companies with their details, assigned price list and status.","id":"REQ-51","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6","I-14"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An active Office Staff user S","id":"AC-52.1","level":"api","then":"The request returns 400 and S keeps the Office Staff role","when":"An Administrator changes S's role to Customer Buyer without a company"},{"given":"Users in statuses Pending, Active and Deactivated","id":"AC-52.2","level":"api","then":"Each user is returned with role, company and status","when":"An Administrator lists users"}],"ears":"The portal shall let Administrators view users with their account status, deactivate and reactivate users, change a user's role between Customer Buyer, Office Staff and Administrator, and link each Customer Buyer to exactly one customer company.","id":"REQ-52","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-17","Q-1"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Cutoff 14:00","id":"AC-53.1","level":"api","then":"The earliest delivery date is Wednesday","when":"An Administrator sets cutoff to 12:00 and the earliest date is requested on Monday 13:00"},{"given":"Low-stock threshold 5 and a product with quantity 7","id":"AC-53.2","level":"api","then":"The product shows Low stock","when":"An Administrator sets the threshold to 10"}],"ears":"The portal shall let Administrators set the low-stock threshold, order cutoff time, timezone, extra non-working dates, maximum delivery days ahead, invoice payment days and tax rate, applying each new value to calculations made after the change.","id":"REQ-53","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12","I-13","I-16","I-17","ASM-5","ASM-27","ASM-28","ASM-29","ASM-31","ASM-32"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product P priced 8.00 on 'Fleet'","id":"AC-54.1","level":"api","then":"An audit entry records Ad1, the time, price list 'Fleet' / product P, and 